zalin = (t:v) (w:spread out/stretch out) (d:zal with the ending in, which links it to the following verb: spreading, stretching out, said of wings and of the heavens) (e:Simbung in a kha ~ leitaw lamah) (b:zal) (r:18.39.26/38.12.1) (q:draft)
Rehob = (t:name) (c:city) (w:Rehob) (d:town in the territory of Asher) (e:leh ~ a lonona gamte tawh) (r:13.6.75/6.19.28) (q:draft)
Rehob = (t:name) (c:male) (w:Rehob) (d:man's name, a Levite who sealed the covenant in Nehemiah) (e:Mika, ~, Hashabiah) (r:16.10.11) (q:draft)
