cihsa = (t:v) (w:said/have said) (d:what has already been said or proposed, cih with sa for a completed action; na cihsa bangin, as you have said) (e:Na ~ bangin hisak in) (b:cih) (r:1.30.34/48.1.9) (q:draft)
deihgawhna = (t:n) (w:desire/lust/craving) (d:strong desire, in the verses mostly evil desire) (e:~ atuam atuam zui-in) (b:deihgawh) (r:55.3.6/45.6.12) (q:draft)
denna = (t:v) (w:throw/cast/hurl) (d:used as a verb, throw into or cast down; leilak denna, cast to the ground) (e:migilote leilak a ~ hi) (b:den) (r:19.147.6/44.22.4) (q:draft)
denna = (t:n) (w:stoning/throwing) (d:act of throwing at or throwing down; suang tawh denna is stoning) (e:Suang tawh ~, sing-atna tawh at tanna) (b:den) (r:58.11.37) (q:draft)
denna = (t:adj) (w:endless/perpetual) (d:in siat denna, ruin that goes on without end, from den always) (e:Siat ~ sungah galte beimang hi) (r:19.9.6) (q:draft, low confidence)
diah = (t:v) (w:dip/soak) (d:put into a liquid) (e:a sisan sungah a puan ~ uh hi) (r:1.37.31/43.13.26) (q:draft)
diah = (t:v) (w:hold back/restrain/delay) (d:figurative, hold back one's anger, be forbearing) (r:23.48.9/45.2.4) (q:draft, low confidence)
