kitheihna = (t:n) (w:sign/token/assurance) (d:something by which a thing is known or made known) (e:amau omzia a ~ lim pawlkhat) (b:kitheih) (r:9.17.18/18.36.33) (q:draft, low confidence)
kituahin = (t:adv) (w:face to face) (d:in maitang kituahin or mai kituahin, with faces meeting; kituah meet with the suffix in) (e:maitang ~ Topa in Moses hopih zel hi) (b:kituah) (r:2.33.11/7.6.22) (q:draft)
kituahin = (t:v) (w:meeting/meet together) (d:kituah meet with the linking suffix in: meeting, coming together, and then) (e:a hanthawn dingin ~ hong paikhawm uh hi) (b:kituah) (r:18.2.11/16.6.10) (q:draft)
koihkhia = (t:v) (w:put out/remove/take away/get rid of) (d:koih put with khia out) (e:Ka omna panin hih numei ~ in la) (b:koih) (r:10.13.17/12.3.2) (q:draft)
koihkik = (t:v) (w:put back/return/restore/replace) (d:koih put with kik again, back) (e:inndei sungah tuate ~ zel uh hi) (b:koih) (r:11.14.28/15.5.15) (q:draft)
laibute = (t:n) (w:books/scrolls) (e:amau ~ hong paipih uh a) (b:laibu) (r:44.19.19/27.7.10) (q:draft)
