gilopa = (t:n) (w:wicked man/evil one/evildoer) (d:gilo evil with pa marking a man: the wicked man; in the Lord's Prayer the evil one) (e:Tua a ~ note lak pan na hawlkhia un) (b:gilo) (r:46.5.13/40.6.13) (q:draft)
