tal = (t:n) (w:forehead) (d:the forehead, tal kolh is a bald forehead) (e:amah a ~ kolh hi a) (r:3.13.41) (q:draft)
tal = (t:adj) (w:male) (d:male of an animal, written after the animal name, as in la-tal, a male donkey, and bawng-tal, a bull) (r:1.12.16/1.32.5) (q:draft)
tawikhaina = (t:n) (w:scales/balance) (d:instrument for weighing) (e:~ man a zangte tungah lungkim hi) (b:tawikhai) (r:20.11.1/18.31.6) (q:draft)
tawisak = (t:v) (w:draw for) (d:draw water for someone, tawi with the suffix sak used for doing it on behalf of another) (e:ading zong tui kong ~ ding hi) (b:tawi) (r:1.24.19/1.24.44) (q:draft)
tawisak = (t:v) (w:make hold/have carry) (d:causative of tawi, put a thing in someone's hand or have someone carry it) (e:pumpeeng khat a tak lamah a ~) (b:tawi) (r:40.27.29/6.6.6) (q:draft)
tehin = (t:v) (w:measure/weigh) (d:form of teh with the linking suffix in, measuring or by measure, tawi tehin is weighing on scales) (e:khut kuak sungah tuite ~) (b:teh) (r:23.40.12/11.7.11) (q:draft)
thatsak = (t:v) (w:have killed/put to death) (d:causative of that, cause or order someone to be killed) (e:kumpi innkuan khempeuh ~ hi) (b:that) (r:12.11.1/44.12.19) (q:draft)
themte = (t:n) (w:pieces/fragments/scraps) (d:small broken bits, a neng a themte are the crumbs and broken pieces left over) (e:a neng a ~ khawm uh a) (b:them) (r:41.6.43/3.14.41) (q:draft)
thenkhat = (t:num) (w:ten thousand) (d:in the verses thenkhat leh tulnih, ten thousand and two thousand, renders twelve thousand) (e:Judah pawl lak pan ~ leh tulnih) (r:66.7.5/66.7.8) (q:draft)
thukimpih = (t:v) (w:agree with/approve/consent to/permit) (d:be of one mind with someone about a matter, grant a request, Topa in hong thukimpih nakleh is if the Lord permits) (e:kumpipa in ka ngetna hong ~ a) (b:thukim) (r:16.2.6/42.11.48) (q:draft)
tualsung = (t:adj) (w:native-born/native/local) (d:belonging to the home community, tualsung mi is a native-born person as opposed to peemta, a foreigner living among them) (e:peemta leh ~ mi adingin ngeina) (r:3.24.22/3.23.42) (q:draft)
tuisuak = (t:v) (w:melt/melt away) (d:literally become water, also said of people whose courage fails) (e:ni a sat ciangin ~ hi) (r:2.16.21/2.15.15) (q:draft)
tumsuk = (t:v) (w:go down/descend/sink into) (d:go down into something, as food into the stomach or people into the grave) (e:a hing tangun Leinuai-ah ~ uh hi) (r:4.16.33/40.15.17) (q:draft)
upmawhna = (t:n) (w:suspicion/jealousy) (d:suspicion of wrongdoing, in the verses a husband's jealous suspicion of his wife) (e:a pasal in ~ lungsim nei-in) (b:upmawh) (r:4.5.14/4.5.25) (q:draft)
uzaw = (t:adj) (w:older/elder) (d:older of two, or older than another person, the opposite is nauzaw) (e:ka tanu ~ Merab om hi) (r:9.18.17/45.9.12) (q:draft)
vakin = (t:v) (w:feed/tend) (d:form of vak with the linking suffix in, giving food to people or animals) (e:hoih takin an ~ kem ding hi) (r:26.34.23/66.12.6) (q:draft)
vakin = (t:v) (w:wander/roam/go about) (d:form of vak with the linking suffix in, going about from place to place) (e:mun keuna-ah ~ khawl nading a zong) (r:42.11.24) (q:draft)
vakin = (t:v) (w:light) (d:form of vak with the linking suffix in, lighting a lamp) (e:meivak ~ a muh matengin) (b:vak) (r:42.15.8) (q:draft, low confidence)
vangliante = (t:adj) (w:mighty) (d:plural form of vanglian, the mighty ones, or after a plural noun as in kumpi vangliante, mighty kings) (e:minam tampite vatmai-in kumpi ~ that a) (b:vanglian) (r:19.135.10/18.34.24) (q:draft)
vawhin = (t:v) (w:saddle/load) (d:form of vawh with the linking suffix in, putting a saddle or load on a pack animal) (e:la van ~ a nasempa kiangah) (r:12.4.24/1.22.3) (q:draft)
vawhin = (t:v) (w:sow/plant) (d:form of vawh with the linking suffix in, sowing seed) (e:khaici ~ na khe tawh tui) (b:vawh) (r:5.11.10) (q:draft)
veh = (t:v) (w:visit/look after/care for) (d:go to see someone in need, as the sick, and care for them) (e:ka om lai takin nong ~ uh hi) (r:40.25.36/42.1.73) (q:draft)
veh = (t:part) (d:sentence-final word of exclamation that calls attention to something happening now, as in listen, people are crying out) (e:Horonain khua-ah mi kiko ~) (r:24.48.3/24.10.22) (q:draft, low confidence)
zaza = (t:num) (w:hundreds/by hundreds) (d:za, hundred, doubled, in groups of a hundred each) (e:a ~ a tultulin a pai laitakin) (r:9.29.2/10.18.1) (q:draft)
zaza = (t:v) (w:keep hearing/hear again and again) (d:za, hear, doubled to show repeated or continual hearing) (e:~ napi tel lo) (r:44.28.26/26.7.26) (q:draft)
zungte = (t:n) (w:roots) (e:Lei sungah a ~ a teek zongin) (b:zung) (r:18.14.8/18.18.16) (q:draft)
