atte = (t:n) (w:writers/secretaries/scribes) (d:at, write, with the plural suffix te, second part of lai-atte, those who write, the secretaries of a king) (e:Ahijah in lai-~ ahi uh hi) (b:at) (r:11.4.3/20.25.1) (q:draft)
