hauhnate = (t:n) (w:riches/wealth) (e:Migilopa in a guksa ~ luakhia kik a) (b:hauhna) (r:18.20.15/19.52.7) (q:draft)
hawmkhia = (t:v) (w:distribute/give out/issue) (d:hand out to many people, also issue a written decree) (e:a kituak letsongte zong ~ hi) (b:hawm) (r:17.2.18/27.6.9) (q:draft)
