upmawh = (t:v) (w:suppose/expect/suspect/think) (d:believe something to be so without being sure) (e:a zi a ~ ciangin) (r:4.5.30/44.25.18) (q:draft)
utzaw = (t:v) (w:prefer/would rather/want more) (d:ut, want, with zaw, more: want one thing more than another) (e:gui-awk ding ka ~ a) (b:ut) (r:18.7.15/23.65.12) (q:draft)
vaikhakna = (t:n) (w:instruction/order/direction) (d:what someone is told or charged to do; vaikhakna lai, a letter of instruction) (e:tua banga ~ thu a ngah khit ciangin) (b:vaikhak) (r:44.16.24/44.9.2) (q:draft)
vakhuno = (t:n) (c:animal) (w:young pigeon/young dove) (d:vakhu, dove, with no, young; in the offerings always kawl vakhuno, young pigeon) (e:kawl ~ nih ahi zongin) (b:vakhu) (r:3.14.22/3.1.14) (q:draft)
velin = (t:v) (w:examine/inspect/look over) (d:vel, examine, with the linking ending in, joining it to the next verb) (e:siampipa in amah ~ a natna pen) (b:vel) (r:3.13.17/3.13.53) (q:draft)
vulgawp = (t:v) (w:wither/wilt/languish) (d:vul, wither, with gawp, completely: dry up and droop, grow faint) (e:lopa bangin kei ka ~ hi) (b:vul) (r:19.102.11/41.4.6) (q:draft)
zam = (t:v) (w:reach out/stretch out/spread) (d:stretch the hand toward something; of branches, spread out or climb over) (e:a hiangte kulh tungah ~ hi) (r:1.49.22/7.5.26) (q:draft)
zawnna = (t:n) (w:poverty/destitution) (d:state of being poor) (e:i tungah ~ hong tung a) (b:zawn) (r:20.24.34/66.2.9) (q:draft)
zuakin = (t:v) (w:sell) (d:zuak, sell, with the linking ending in, joining it to the next verb) (e:a neih khempeuh ~ tua lo a va lei) (b:zuak) (r:40.13.44/12.4.7) (q:draft)
Ama = (t:pron) (w:his/him/he) (d:third person singular pronoun ama, written with a capital when it refers to God or begins a sentence; his, him or he depending on its place in the sentence) (e:~ tung bekah lametna ka nei hi) (b:ama) (r:25.3.24/41.1.3) (q:draft)
Awle = (t:n) (c:animal) (w:Leviathan/crocodile) (d:awle, crocodile, written with a capital for the sea monster Leviathan) (e:~ a mu mi peuhmah lau-in) (b:awle) (r:18.41.9/19.104.26) (q:draft)
