siacip = (t:v) (w:be ruined/perish/be destroyed completely) (d:sia be spoiled with cip, completely; also cried out as a ruin, a ruin) (e:Nineveh khuapi ~ ta hi) (b:sia) (r:34.3.7/26.21.27) (q:draft)
