kaito = (t:v) (w:pull up/draw up/lift up) (d:kai pull with to upward) (e:tua khempeuh vantungah a ~ kik hi) (b:kai) (r:44.11.10/19.30.1) (q:draft)
kamsiatna = (t:n) (w:misfortune/hardship/adversity) (d:trouble or ill fortune that befalls someone; kamsiatna thuak tahen is a curse on someone) (e:khang tawntungin ~ tuak kei ning) (r:19.10.6/4.20.14) (q:draft)
kangtumin = (t:v) (w:burn up/consume) (d:kangtum with the linking suffix in) (e:vantungte mei in ~) (b:kangtum) (r:61.3.12/11.18.38) (q:draft)
kawikawina = (t:n) (d:kawikawi about, here and there, with na; follows a verb and makes a noun of doing that action all around or to one another, as gen kawikawina telling around and zon kawikawina searching about) (e:Gam sung teng a zon’ ~ uhah) (b:kawikawi) (r:26.39.15/24.3.13) (q:draft)
kawmah = (t:prep) (w:among/between/in the midst of) (d:kawm the space between, with ah at: in between or in among) (e:mihonte ~ Jesuh’ nung a zui hi) (b:kawm) (r:41.5.27/4.11.33) (q:draft)
kelkel = (t:adv) (d:expressive word after a verb for quick repeated movement: liing kelkel is tremble all over, shake and shake; tee kelkel, of eyes, is sparkle) (e:a khuk uh liing ~ ding hi) (r:26.7.17/22.4.1) (q:draft)
khainiangte = (t:n) (w:chains) (d:plural; ornamental chains of gold or silver) (e:mangkawlsing zakhat bawlin ~ tungah koih hi) (b:khainiang) (r:14.3.16/2.28.14) (q:draft)
