suahkhiat = (t:v) (w:turn out/result) (d:of a matter, how it ends) (e:a thu hong bangci ~ cih) (b:suah) (r:8.3.18) (q:draft)
suangkang = (t:n) (c:stone) (w:marble/limestone/chalk) (d:white stone, from suang stone and kang white; marble in buildings, limestone or chalk when burned or crushed) (e:~ khuamte kiphut a) (r:17.1.6/23.27.9) (q:draft)
suat = (t:v) (w:load/lay on/put on) (d:place a load or yoke on someone) (e:midangte’ liangko tungah a ~ uh hangin) (r:40.23.4/14.10.9) (q:draft)
