teelpa = (t:n) (w:chosen one) (d:the man whom someone has chosen; pa marks a man) (e:Ka ~ tawh thuciamna khat ka bawl zo a) (b:teel) (r:19.89.3/19.106.23) (q:draft)
teelpa = (t:n) (w:chooser) (d:the one who chooses, as in note hong teelpa, whoever chooses you) (e:note hong ~ in a etsathuai ahi hi) (b:teel) (r:23.41.24) (q:draft, low confidence)
