toin = (t:part) (w:up/upward) (d:the particle to with the linking ending in; after a verb, doing it upward and then the next action follows) (e:Moses in a khut laam ~ a ciangkhut tawh) (b:to) (r:4.20.11/28.11.4) (q:draft)
