gimsakin = (t:v) (w:afflicting/troubling/oppressing) (d:gimsak, cause to suffer, with the linking ending in; another verb follows) (e:thuman mite ~, sumgolh na la uh a) (b:gimsak) (r:30.5.12/46.8.12) (q:draft)
git = (t:v) (w:draw/mark out/score) (d:draw or scratch a line on a surface; of soil, break it up in lines, harrow) (e:tua leitsek tung ~ in) (r:26.4.1/18.26.10) (q:draft, low confidence)
