sasak = (t:v) (w:make sing/let sing) (d:la sa, sing, with sak, cause or let) (e:lungdamna tawh la ~ unla) (r:23.42.11/19.5.11) (q:draft)
satzan = (t:v) (w:hack to pieces/cut to pieces/break down) (d:sat, strike or cut, with zan: strike until the thing is broken apart) (e:a namsau uh tawh hong ~ ding uh hi) (r:26.16.40/23.45.2) (q:draft)
sawlkawm = (t:n) (c:plant) (w:bush/thicket/undergrowth) (e:~ nuai-ah kilomin omkhawm uh hi) (r:18.30.7/42.20.37) (q:draft)
sawlsa = (t:v) (w:commanded/ordered/directed) (d:sawl, command or send, with sa marking a completed action; a sawlsa bangin is as he had commanded) (e:Moses in amaute a ~ bangin) (b:sawl) (r:6.4.12/24.47.7) (q:draft)
sawlteng = (t:n) (w:all that is commanded) (d:sawl, command or send, with teng, all: everything that one was told to do or say) (e:a ~ a sepna hangin) (b:sawl) (r:42.17.9/43.12.50) (q:draft)
