seekna = (t:n) (w:shaping/working/making) (d:the work or the place of shaping stone, metal or clay; suangte seekna is cutting of stones, leiseek seekna is brickmaking) (e:bulh ding suangte ~ leh sing zep) (b:seek) (r:2.31.3/10.12.31) (q:draft)
seekte = (t:n) (w:smiths/craftsmen/makers) (d:those who shape a material: kham seekte goldsmiths, suang seekte stonecutters, beel seekte potters) (e:kham ~ khempeuh in a milim uh) (b:seek) (r:24.51.17/13.22.2) (q:draft)
seelsim = (t:v) (w:hide/conceal/keep hidden) (e:Topa in ko tegel a hong ~ hi) (r:24.36.26/24.41.8) (q:draft)
