khiate = (t:n) (d:those who, or the things that, do the action out or away; khia out, joined to the verb before it, with the plural te: a pusuak khiate, the things that come out) (e:Mihingte sung panin a pusuak ~ in) (b:khia) (r:41.7.20/19.119.118) (q:draft)
