bangkhat = (t:pron) (w:something/anything) (d:often followed by peuhpeuh or teitei, something or other) (e:Amaute’ nek ding ~ peuhpeuh pia un) (r:40.14.16/58.8.3) (q:draft)
banglel = (t:adj) (w:just like/no better than) (d:bang, like, with lel, merely; placed after a noun and a, one who is no more than that) (e:hih uisi a ~ mi khat in) (r:10.16.9/12.18.21) (q:draft)
