batsakkik = (t:v) (w:restore) (d:batsak, make like, with kik, again; a ngei batsakkik is to make a thing as it was before) (e:biakinn a ngei ~ ding ngaihsun hi) (b:batsak) (r:14.24.4/14.34.10) (q:draft)
bawlphat = (t:v) (w:restore/repair/put right) (d:form of bawlpha used before other words and endings; bawlphat thakna is renewal) (e:~ zawh nawn loh dongin kisia ding) (b:bawlpha) (r:20.29.1/56.3.5) (q:draft)
bawlsiatnate = (t:n) (w:persecutions/mistreatments/acts of oppression) (e:leh ~ ka thuak khit uh ciangin) (b:bawlsiatna) (r:52.2.2/23.58.9) (q:draft)
bawngleeng = (t:n) (w:ox cart/cart) (d:bawng, cow or ox, with leeng, cart: a cart drawn by oxen) (e:a pua ~ a netcipsuk bangin) (r:30.2.13) (q:draft)
beelsekpa = (t:n) (w:potter) (d:beel, pot, and sek, shape, with pa for a man: the man who shapes pots) (e:~ in hoih a sak bangin) (r:24.18.4/24.18.6) (q:draft)
behtangun = (t:adv) (w:by their clans/clan by clan) (d:beh, clan, with tang and the plural ending un; of a count of men reckoned by clans) (e:Kohath mi pasal a ~ tulnih le zasagih) (r:4.4.34) (q:draft, low confidence)
beibei = (t:v) (w:pass away/keep passing) (d:bei, come to an end, doubled for something that goes on passing) (e:leitung deihnate a ~ ding hita a) (r:62.2.17/26.12.22) (q:draft)
