besan = (t:n) (c:plant) (w:lentil) (d:named with bepi, beans, among foods) (e:~ a dimna mun Lehi-ah Filistiate kikaikhawm) (r:10.23.11/10.17.28) (q:draft)
bi = (t:v) (w:touch) (d:touch a thing with something held in the hand) (e:Amah in ka muk hong ~ a) (r:23.6.7) (q:draft)
bi = (t:n) (c:plant) (w:hay/grass) (d:named between wood and straw as a building material) (e:sing, ~, lopa, a nam tuamtuam) (r:46.3.12) (q:draft, low confidence)
biaknopna = (t:n) (w:desire to worship/devotion) (d:biak, worship, and nop, want, with the noun suffix na; milim biaknopna lungsim is a heart set on worshipping idols) (e:milim ~ lungsim ka beisak ding hi) (r:38.13.2/28.5.4) (q:draft)
