buisum = (t:v) (w:be crippled/be maimed/wither) (d:of a hand or arm, lose its power and become useless) (e:ka taklam khut ~ ta hen) (r:19.137.5/18.31.22) (q:draft, low confidence)
buksimte = (t:n) (w:men in ambush/ambushers) (d:buksim, lie in ambush, with the plural te: those who lie in wait) (e:Tua ciangin a ~ diangkhia pah uh a) (b:buksim) (r:6.8.19/6.8.21) (q:draft)
