bulphuhin = (t:v) (w:based on/on the basis of) (d:bulphuh, take as the basis, with the linking suffix in; placed after the thing that is the basis) (e:mite’ nasepna ~ a teel hi loin) (b:bulphuh) (r:45.11.6/45.4.16) (q:draft)
bulte = (t:n) (w:foundations/bases) (d:plural of bul, base; leitung bulte is the foundations of the earth, and of a wheel the hubs) (e:leinuai-a leitung ~ a kivel theih ciang) (b:bul) (r:24.31.37/11.7.33) (q:draft)
busak = (t:v) (w:hide/conceal) (d:causative of bu, hide: put someone into hiding) (e:misite’ gam sungah hong ~ in) (b:bu) (r:18.14.13/7.16.9) (q:draft)
ciahkhawm = (t:v) (w:return together/go back together) (d:ciah, return, with khawm, together) (e:nang tawh kong ~ ding uh hi) (b:ciah) (r:8.1.10/38.10.9) (q:draft)
ciahkikte = (t:n) (w:those who returned/returned exiles) (d:ciahkik, return, with the plural te) (e:Biakinn nasemte sung panin a hong ~) (b:ciahkik) (r:16.7.46/15.2.1) (q:draft)
cialin = (t:v) (w:hire) (d:form of cial, hire, with the linking suffix in, hiring and then going on to the next action) (e:amah in kei hong ~ kei in) (b:cial) (r:7.18.4/44.6.11) (q:draft)
cialna = (t:n) (w:hiring/hire) (d:noun form of cial, hire: the hiring of people, what is spent to hire them) (e:thu ngaihsun thei lo mite ~ hi) (b:cial) (r:7.9.4/42.8.43) (q:draft)
ciatna = (t:n) (d:ciat, each, with the noun suffix na, placed after a verb: the fact or the way of each one doing it) (e:theihna i neih ~ thu i thei hi) (b:ciat) (r:46.8.1/13.28.15) (q:draft, low confidence)
