cihtakin = (t:adv) (w:truly/utterly) (d:placed between a repeated word, as hai cihtakin hai, to say that it is so in the full sense of the word) (e:Amaute muhdah ~ ka mudah a) (b:cih) (r:19.139.22/23.19.11) (q:draft)
ciil = (t:adj) (w:aged/matured/fine) (d:of wine, well aged and of the best kind) (e:a ~ mahmah leenggahzu nekna pawi) (r:23.25.6) (q:draft, low confidence)
ciimsak = (t:v) (w:make wise/make discerning) (d:causative of ciim; mi ciimsate ciimsak is to make those who are already discerning more so) (e:Mi ciimsate ~ semsemin) (b:ciim) (r:20.1.5) (q:draft, low confidence)
