cineel = (t:adj) (w:smooth-skinned/smooth) (d:having smooth skin without hair, the opposite of mulnei, hairy) (e:kei pen ~ mi ka hi hi) (r:1.27.11/23.18.7) (q:draft)
cingta = (t:v) (w:be completed/be fulfilled/be up) (d:cing, be complete, with ta, which shows that it has now come about; of a set time) (e:Ka hun ~ ahih ciangin) (b:cing) (r:1.29.21/26.22.4) (q:draft)
