keumang = (t:v) (w:dry up/wither away) (d:keu, dry, with mang, away: dry up completely, of pastures and trees) (e:singkung khempeuh ~ khinta hi) (r:29.1.19/24.23.10) (q:draft)
khagilo = (t:n) (w:evil spirit) (d:kha, spirit, with gilo, evil) (e:ama kiang panin ~ kihemkhia hi) (r:9.16.23/9.18.10) (q:draft)
khahsak = (t:v) (w:release/set free) (d:khah, release, with sak, here doing the action for someone: release to or for someone; in Psalms 81:6 let the hands go free of a load) (e:Barabbas hong ~ in) (b:khah) (r:42.23.18/41.15.11) (q:draft)
khaih = (t:v) (w:strain/filter) (d:pass a liquid through something to take out what is in it; in Proverbs 9:2 of preparing wine) (e:thovai om loh nadingin tui na ~ uh hangin) (r:40.23.24/20.9.2) (q:draft)
khaikhawm = (t:v) (w:crucify together/hang together) (d:khai, hang, with khawm, together: hang on crosses along with another) (e:singlamteh tungah a ~ uh hi) (b:khai) (r:40.27.38/42.23.33) (q:draft)
khaito = (t:v) (w:hang up/raise/put up) (d:khai, hang, with to, up: raise a banner or hang up a curtain) (e:mite’ muh dingin lim khat ~ un) (b:khai) (r:23.62.10/2.40.8) (q:draft)
khakham = (t:n) (w:anguish/grief) (d:in khakham vei, suffer deep distress of spirit, grow faint with grief) (e:nupi ~ vei-in a sibup hi) (r:24.15.9/19.77.10) (q:draft, low confidence)
khaktanin = (t:v) (w:blocking/stopping/cutting off) (d:khaktan, block or stop, with the linking suffix in) (e:Gihon tui tungnungte ~) (b:khaktan) (r:14.32.30/24.47.4) (q:draft)
khaktanzo = (t:v) (w:be able to stop/hinder/reverse) (d:khaktan, block or stop, with zo, be able) (e:a ~ ding kua om ahi hiam) (b:khaktan) (r:18.9.12/23.43.13) (q:draft)
khamkhit = (t:v) (w:be satisfied/have eaten enough) (d:kham, be full from eating, with khit, finished: a khamkhit uh ciangin is when they had eaten their fill) (e:Mi khempeuh in ne-in a ~ uh ciangin) (r:42.9.17/41.8.8) (q:draft)
khangkham = (t:v) (w:crack/split open) (d:of a wall or a rock, break open in a crack; khangkham sak is split) (e:amah in suangpi ~ sak a) (r:23.48.21/23.30.13) (q:draft)
khangkikte = (t:n) (w:next generation/later generations) (d:khangkik, the generation that follows, with plural te: those who come after) (e:a ~ in phawk nawn lo ding hi) (r:21.1.11/19.48.12) (q:draft)
khangmite = (t:n) (w:generation/people of the generation) (d:khangmi, a person of a certain generation, with plural te; tua khangmite is that generation) (e:tua ~ khempeuh zong si khin uh a) (b:khangmi) (r:7.2.10/58.3.10) (q:draft)
khangsakin = (t:v) (w:making grow/enlarging/increasing) (d:khangsak, make grow or increase, with the linking suffix in) (e:Leinuai in a duhna ~) (b:khangsak) (r:23.5.14/23.44.14) (q:draft)
khangthakte = (t:n) (w:new generation/next generation/coming generation) (d:khangthak, new generation, with plural te) (e:hong piang ding ~ tungah) (r:19.78.4/24.2.31) (q:draft)
khangualte = (t:n) (w:contemporaries/peers/companions) (d:those of the same age or generation as oneself, with plural te) (e:ka ~ lakah Jew biakna lamah) (r:48.1.14/19.45.7) (q:draft)
khansak = (t:v) (w:make grow/raise up/build up) (d:khan, grow, with the causative sak: make a plant grow, build up a body of people, raise up a leader) (e:Khrih pumpi a ~ theihna ding) (b:khan) (r:49.4.12/32.4.10) (q:draft)
khansauna = (t:n) (w:long life) (d:khansau, live long, with the noun suffix na) (e:hauhna, minthanna, le ~ ahi hi) (b:khansau) (r:20.22.4/11.3.11) (q:draft)
khantoh = (t:v) (w:progress/advance/grow) (d:khan, grow, with toh, upward: develop and prosper; khantoh nading is for the progress or advancement of) (e:note’ ~ nading le upna hangin) (b:khan) (r:50.1.25/27.11.20) (q:draft)
khantohna = (t:n) (w:progress/advancement/welfare) (d:khantoh, progress, with the noun suffix na) (e:Mi khempeuh in na ~ hong muhtheih nadingin) (b:khantoh) (r:54.4.15/17.10.3) (q:draft)
khaudum = (t:n) (w:blue cord) (d:khau, cord, with dum, blue) (e:~ khat tawh dialpi tungah na gak ding) (r:2.28.37/2.28.28) (q:draft)
khauhsakin = (t:v) (w:hardening/making stubborn) (d:khauhsak, harden, with the linking suffix in) (e:Keimah in Faro’ lungsim ~) (b:khauhsak) (r:2.14.4/5.2.30) (q:draft)
khautang = (t:n) (w:sackcloth) (d:coarse cloth; khautang puan is a garment of sackcloth, worn in mourning or repentance) (e:amaute in ~ puan silhin) (r:66.11.3/42.10.13) (q:draft)
khawhlawh = (t:v) (w:farm as a tenant/work land for hire) (d:work the land of another man for a share of the crop; lo khawhlawh is a tenant farmer and khawhlawh sak is let land out to tenants) (e:lo ~ dangte khosak ding hi) (r:40.21.41/42.20.9) (q:draft)
khawhlawhsak = (t:v) (w:rent out/let out to tenants) (d:khawhlawh, farm as a tenant, with the causative sak: give land to others to farm) (e:midangte ~ ding hi) (b:khawhlawh) (r:42.20.16/41.12.1) (q:draft)
khawhsak = (t:v) (w:make plough/farm for) (d:khawh, farm or work the land, with sak: make an animal or person work the land, or in Luke 17:7 work the land for someone) (e:kol bulhin lo ~ ding ka ngaihsun hi) (b:khawh) (r:28.10.11/42.17.7) (q:draft)
khawlsakin = (t:v) (w:stopping/making rest) (d:khawlsak, make stop or rest, with the linking suffix in) (e:amah in a puate tawlkhat ~) (b:khawlsak) (r:10.6.13/27.8.11) (q:draft)
khawmna = (t:n) (w:togetherness/fellowship) (d:khawm, together, with the noun suffix na, after a verb: the doing of something together, as kipawl khawmna, fellowship, and gamtat khawmna, acting together) (e:kipawl ~, khomun balnenna leh thungetna) (b:khawm) (r:44.2.42/9.10.11) (q:draft)
khawngai = (t:adj) (w:desolate/forlorn/lonely) (d:sad and alone like one bereaved) (e:Tamar lungzuang ~-in a om hi) (r:10.13.20/19.35.12) (q:draft)
khegingte = (t:n) (w:sound of hooves/footsteps/clatter) (d:kheging, the sound made by feet or hooves, with plural te) (e:Sakol ~ za-in, sakol leeng gingte) (b:kheging) (r:24.47.3/7.5.28) (q:draft)
khempa = (t:n) (w:deceiver/cheat) (d:khem, deceive, with pa, a man: a man who deceives, as in mi khempa) (e:tua mi ~ in) (b:khem) (r:40.27.63/39.1.14) (q:draft)
khemzawh = (t:v) (w:deceive/beguile) (d:khem, deceive, with zawh, form of zo, manage: succeed in deceiving, take in) (e:zuau ngian tawh Eve a ~ bangin) (r:47.11.3/20.9.18) (q:draft)
khenkhamin = (t:v) (w:dividing/splitting apart/breaking down) (d:khenkham, split apart or break in pieces, with the linking suffix in) (e:ama mite’ mai-ah tuite ~) (b:khenkham) (r:23.63.12/24.18.7) (q:draft)
khepekte = (t:n) (w:feet) (d:khepek, the foot below the ankle, with plural te; set beside khete, legs) (e:a ~ uh bawng khe tawh kibang hi) (b:khepek) (r:26.1.7/27.2.33) (q:draft)
khialkhin = (t:v) (w:have sinned/have done wrong) (d:khial, do wrong, with khin, already) (e:Topa tungah ~ ka hih manin) (b:khial) (r:33.7.9/42.15.21) (q:draft)
khiathei = (t:v) (w:be able to interpret/interpret) (d:of dreams: explain the meaning, with thei, be able; mang khiathei is one who can interpret a dream) (e:Kei’ pilna tawh mang a ~ ka hi kei hi) (r:1.41.16/1.40.8) (q:draft)
khiato = (t:adv) (w:up out/up and out) (d:khia, out, with to, up, placed after a verb for movement out and upward: po khiato is spring up, kai khiato is pull up out) (e:khau tawh Jeremiah a kai ~ uh hi) (b:khia) (r:24.38.13/19.85.11) (q:draft)
khiatsukna = (t:n) (w:casting down/being thrown down) (d:khiatsuk, throw down, with the noun suffix na; khiatsukna thuak is be thrown down) (e:kat meiphual sungah ~ thuakin) (b:khiatsuk) (r:66.20.10/66.12.10) (q:draft)
khikcip = (t:v) (w:be still/be numb/stiffen) (d:become stiff and unmoving, as people frozen with fear, or a heart that feels nothing) (e:a khen’ mateng amaute ~ uh hi) (r:2.15.16/19.119.70) (q:draft, low confidence)
khimin = (t:v) (w:wearing on the head/putting on) (d:khim, put on a headdress, with the linking suffix in: having on the head) (e:a lu tungah sakhituihup ~) (b:khim) (r:66.10.1/26.44.18) (q:draft)
khinkhiat = (t:v) (w:remove/take away) (d:form of khinkhia, remove, used before another word such as bangin or khit) (e:Israel ka ~ bangin) (b:khinkhia) (r:12.23.27/44.13.22) (q:draft)
khip = (t:v) (w:put on the head/wear on the head) (d:form of khim, put on a headdress; dial khip is a turban, a cloth worn on the head) (e:a lu tungah a ~ ding uh aite) (r:26.13.18/26.21.26) (q:draft)
khitzawh = (t:conj) (w:after) (d:placed after a verb or after tua: once the action is over; tua khitzawh phetin is immediately after that) (e:Tua ~ phetin ak hong khuangta hi) (r:40.26.74/44.1.3) (q:draft)
khoh = (t:v) (w:urge/press/entreat) (d:press someone strongly to do or not to do something) (e:Zeisu nakpi-in a ~ uh ciangin) (r:42.24.29/24.36.25) (q:draft)
khohsate = (t:n) (w:invited guests/those invited) (d:khoh, urge or invite, with sa, already done, and plural te: those who have been invited to a feast) (e:a ~ kiangah gen dingin) (b:khohsa) (r:42.14.17/40.22.3) (q:draft)
khom = (t:v) (w:last/be enough for) (d:of food or goods, be enough to last through a length of time) (e:kum thum sung ~ ding an hong piang ding hi) (r:3.25.21/2.16.29) (q:draft)
khongkhaite = (t:n) (w:sorcerers/soothsayers) (d:khongkhai, sorcery or soothsaying, with plural te: those who practise it, named beside aisante, diviners) (e:~ le aisante thu ngai uh hi) (b:khongkhai) (r:5.18.14/23.2.6) (q:draft)
khozo = (t:v) (w:restrain/hold back/withstand) (d:manage to check or hold back someone, by urging or by force; zo is be able) (e:a biak loh nadingun a ~ liailiai uh) (r:44.14.18/27.8.4) (q:draft, low confidence)
khrisolait = (t:n) (c:stone) (w:chrysolite) (d:a precious stone, named among the suangmanpha) (e:a sagihna-ah ~ suangmanpha) (r:66.21.20/26.28.13) (q:draft)
khuadakto = (t:v) (w:look up/lift the eyes) (d:khuadak, look around, with to, up) (e:Na kimkotah ~ inla mu in) (b:khuadak) (r:23.49.18/5.3.27) (q:draft)
khuadaktoh = (t:v) (w:look up) (d:khuadak look with toh, upward; the form of khuadakto used before leh) (e:Ka ~ leh gun gei-ah tuutal khat) (b:khuadakto) (r:27.8.3/1.18.2) (q:draft)
khualte = (t:n) (w:strangers/foreigners/sojourners) (d:khual with the plural te; in mi khualte, people from elsewhere who live among another people) (e:a hong peem mi ~ leh note) (b:khual) (r:3.25.45/3.17.10) (q:draft)
khualte = (t:n) (w:those who have regard for/those who consider) (d:khual, have regard or concern for, with te, those who) (e:Mi genthei a ~ thupha ngah) (b:khual) (r:19.41.1) (q:draft)
khuamlu = (t:n) (w:capital/top of a pillar) (d:khuam pillar with lu head: the top of a post or pillar) (e:a ~ zepnate a kizutna zong ngun) (r:2.38.17/2.38.19) (q:draft)
khuamuh = (t:v) (w:see/have sight) (d:khua, the surroundings, with muh, a form of mu see; in the verses always khuamuh nading, for seeing) (e:Topa in ~ nading mit) (r:20.20.12/66.3.18) (q:draft)
khuanai = (t:n) (w:vicinity of a town/near the town) (d:khua town with nai near: the area close to a town; Jerusalem khuanai is near Jerusalem) (e:Bethfage le Bethany ~ a tun ciangin) (r:42.19.29/40.21.1) (q:draft)
khuanawlah = (t:adv) (w:outside the town/out of the town) (d:khuanawl, the edge of a town, with ah, to or at) (e:khut lenin ~ a paipih hi) (b:khuanawl) (r:41.8.23/44.14.19) (q:draft)
khuaphawk = (t:v) (w:be aware/take notice/be alert) (d:in the verses always with lo: khuaphawk loin, unaware of anything, without a care, where the NIV has complacency and at rest) (e:leitung khempeuh ~ loin nuamtakin om uh) (r:38.1.11/26.30.9) (q:draft)
khuazing = (t:n) (w:gloom/deep darkness/thick darkness) (d:paired with khuamial, darkness) (e:khuamial le meii le ~ in a tuamcip) (r:5.4.11/18.34.22) (q:draft)
khuhsak = (t:v) (w:cover over/cast over/cover) (d:khuh cover with sak: spread a net over someone, or cover sins) (e:ka ngen kong ~ ding a) (b:khuh) (r:26.32.3/59.5.20) (q:draft)
khuisatnate = (t:n) (w:sighs/groanings/sighing) (e:ka ~ na za hi) (b:khuisatna) (r:19.38.9/23.21.2) (q:draft)
khuksung = (t:n) (w:pit/inside of the pit) (d:khuk pit with sung inside; in the verses always hell khuksung, the pit of hell, where the NIV has destruction and curse) (e:mi peuhpeuh hell ~ tung ta hen) (r:48.1.9/50.3.19) (q:draft)
khumkhelh = (t:v) (w:surpass/exceed/excel) (d:be greater than all others in something, which is marked by tawh) (e:leitung kumpi khempeuh ~ hi) (r:11.10.23/14.9.22) (q:draft)
khumsak = (t:v) (w:have put in prison/imprison/have shut in) (d:khum put in with the causative sak: have someone put in, as into prison) (e:thong sungah a ~ hi) (b:khum) (r:40.14.3/40.18.30) (q:draft)
khumzang = (t:n) (w:roof/rooftop/housetop) (d:the top of a building, from khum roof; biakinn khumzang is the roof of the temple) (e:biakinn ~ a sangpen munah) (r:40.4.5/12.23.12) (q:draft)
khungnung = (t:adj) (w:uppermost/farthest) (d:at the upper end; leilu lam a khungnung pen is the part farthest to the north, the northern frontier) (e:Leilu lam a ~ penah Dan minamte) (r:26.48.1/26.48.23) (q:draft, low confidence)
khupin = (t:v) (w:closing/folding down/turning down) (d:khup with the linking suffix in: closing a book, or lowering wings to cover the body) (e:a laibu ~ biakinn nasempa tungah) (b:khup) (r:42.4.20/26.1.11) (q:draft)
khuplet = (t:v) (w:surpass/overwhelm/overthrow) (d:get the better of something completely: of wisdom, surpass that of others; of victory, swallow up death; of arguments, overthrow them) (e:Izipt pilna khempeuh ~ hi) (r:11.4.30/46.15.54) (q:draft)
khuta = (t:n) (w:in the hand/on the hand) (d:khut hand with the ending a, in or on) (e:kumpipa in a ~ a tawi kumpi ciangkhut) (b:khut) (r:17.5.2/24.40.4) (q:draft)
khuthawm = (t:n) (w:empty hand) (d:khut hand with hawm empty; in the verses always khuthawm guakin, empty-handed) (e:~ guakin na paisak kei ding hi) (r:5.15.13/42.1.53) (q:draft)
khutkuak = (t:n) (w:hollow of the hand/cupped hand/handful) (d:khut hand with kuak hollow: the hollow of the hand and what it holds) (e:ama ~ sungah tuite tehin) (r:23.40.12/11.20.10) (q:draft)
khutngakna = (t:n) (w:laying on of hands) (d:khut hand with ngakna, the laying on: placing the hands on someone to bless or appoint) (e:pawlpi upate’ ~ tawh) (r:54.4.14/54.5.22) (q:draft)
khuttung = (t:n) (w:hand) (d:khut hand with tung, on: what is on or in the hand; khuttung panin is from the hand of) (e:Topa’ ~ panin tua hai ka la) (r:24.25.17/24.25.28) (q:draft)
khutun = (t:n) (w:in their hands/with their hands) (d:khut hand with un, the plural uh joined with in: in or with their hands) (e:a veilam ~ meilah tawi-in) (b:khut) (r:7.7.20/5.1.25) (q:draft)
ki-umcip = (t:v) (w:be enclosed/be shut in/be besieged) (d:um surround with cip tightly and the passive ki; a ki-umcip before a noun means enclosed, as a garden, or besieged, as a city) (e:a ~ huan hi a) (r:22.4.12/23.1.8) (q:draft)
kialpite = (t:n) (w:famines/famine) (d:kialpi with the plural te) (e:pulnatna le ~ tawh na sih nadingun) (b:kialpi) (r:24.34.17/66.18.8) (q:draft)
kibaang = (t:v) (w:be put on/be laid on/be worn) (d:baang with ki, passive: of a yoke, be laid on an animal; of clothing, be on a person) (e:kol a ~ ngei lo bawngpi) (b:baang) (r:9.6.7/3.19.19) (q:draft)
kibangkim = (t:adj) (w:all alike/all the same/equal) (d:kibang same with kim all) (e:ni khempeuh ~ hi) (r:45.14.5/48.3.28) (q:draft)
kibawlkholsa = (t:adj) (w:prepared beforehand/made ready) (d:kibawlkhol be prepared in advance with sa, already) (e:note ading a ~ Gamah hong pai) (r:40.25.34/60.1.5) (q:draft)
kibawlpha = (t:v) (w:be reformed/be renewed/be put right) (d:bawlpha put right with ki, passive or of oneself: mend one's ways under correction, or be made new) (e:amaute ~ tuan lo uh hi) (b:bawlpha) (r:24.2.30/51.3.9) (q:draft)
kibawlphat = (t:v) (w:be repaired/be rebuilt/reform) (d:form of kibawlpha used before kik, hun and similar words) (e:khuapi a ~ hun hong tung ding) (b:kibawlpha) (r:24.31.38/24.19.11) (q:draft)
kibawltawm = (t:v) (w:make oneself/make oneself out to be) (d:bawltawm with ki, of oneself: make oneself into something, as unclean by what one touches, or like an angel in appearance) (e:vantungmi tawh a kibangin ~ thei hi) (b:bawltawm) (r:47.11.14/3.11.43) (q:draft)
kibawltawm = (t:adj) (w:artificial/man-made) (d:a kibawltawm before a noun: made by people, not natural) (e:a ~ bual leh Galkap Inn) (b:bawltawm) (r:16.3.16) (q:draft)
kibeh = (t:v) (w:be related/be kin) (d:beh clan with ki, one another: belong to the same family; a kibeh is a relative) (e:eite a ~ i hi hi) (b:beh) (r:1.13.8/43.18.26) (q:draft)
kibeh = (t:v) (w:be added/increase) (d:in kibeh laplap, keep being added, pile up) (e:a mawkna thu mah ~ laplap hi) (r:21.5.7) (q:draft, low confidence)
kibia = (t:v) (w:be worshipped) (d:passive of bia) (e:a ~ na khempeuh ahi zongin) (b:bia) (r:53.2.4/11.9.3) (q:draft)
kibia = (t:v) (w:offer oneself) (d:give oneself as an offering to God) (e:ama pumpi kipia-in, ~-in, eite tangding) (r:49.5.2) (q:draft, low confidence)
kibuakin = (t:v) (w:sprinkling on oneself/throwing on oneself) (d:kibuak with the linking suffix in: putting dust or ashes on oneself as a sign of grief) (e:a lutang uhah leivui ~) (b:kibuak) (r:66.18.19/42.10.13) (q:draft)
kibulhsa = (t:adj) (w:fastened on/set in place/chained) (d:kibulh be put on with sa, already: of lamps set on a stand, or of people put in chains) (e:meivak a ~ tawh a meivakte) (b:kibulh) (r:2.39.37/23.45.14) (q:draft)
kiciamtehsa = (t:adj) (w:recorded/written down/marked out) (d:kiciamteh be recorded with sa, already) (e:om dingin a ~ mite khempeuh) (b:kiciamteh) (r:23.4.3/65.1.4) (q:draft)
kiciing = (t:adj) (w:cultivated/planted) (d:of an olive tree, grown and tended by people, as opposed to gamlak, wild) (e:A ~ oliv kung a hiangte kisatkhia-in) (r:45.11.17/45.11.24) (q:draft)
kicimgawp = (t:v) (w:collapse utterly/crumble/be broken down) (d:kicim collapse with gawp, completely) (e:Thebes khuapikulh khempeuh ~ ding a) (b:kicim) (r:26.30.16/19.46.6) (q:draft)
kicingtaak = (t:adj) (w:complete/perfect/made complete) (d:cingtaak with ki; a kicingtaak lo is what is incomplete) (e:a ~ lo thuteng maimang ding hi) (b:cingtaak) (r:46.13.10/62.2.5) (q:draft)
kidantat = (t:v) (w:be punished/be condemned) (d:passive with ki of dan tat, inflict a penalty) (e:thuman mudahte ~ ding hi) (r:19.34.21/2.21.20) (q:draft)
kideidanna = (t:n) (w:distinction/difference/discrimination) (d:kideidan with na: treating people differently from one another; kideidanna om lo is there is no distinction) (e:cih bangin ~ om nawn lo a) (r:48.3.28/45.10.12) (q:draft)
kidoin = (t:v) (w:fighting each other/contending/opposing) (d:kido with the linking suffix in) (e:kumpite khat leh khat ~) (b:kido) (r:12.3.23/65.1.9) (q:draft)
