Azaz = (t:name) (c:male) (w:Azaz) (d:a man of Reuben, son of Shema) (e:Shema’ tapa ~, a tapa Bela ahi hi) (r:13.5.8) (q:draft)
Aziel = (t:name) (c:male) (w:Aziel/Jaaziel) (d:a Levite musician; Jaaziel in the NIV) (e:Zekhariah, ~, Shemiramoth) (r:13.15.20) (q:draft)
Bawl = (t:v) (w:make/create) (d:bawl, make, written with a capital of God as Maker: eite hong Bawl Topa, the Lord our Maker) (e:eite hong ~ Topa mai-ah khukdin’ ni) (b:bawl) (r:19.95.6) (q:draft)
Be-er = (t:name) (c:place) (w:Beer) (d:a well where Israel camped in the desert, and a town to which Jotham fled) (e:Tua lai panin ~ munah pai uh hi) (r:4.21.16/7.9.21) (q:draft)
