Ebron = (t:name) (c:place) (w:Ebron/Abdon) (d:a town on the border of Asher; the NIV reads Abdon) (e:~, Rehob, Hammon, Kanah) (r:6.19.28) (q:draft)
Efai = (t:name) (c:male) (w:Ephai) (d:a man of Netophah whose sons came to Gedaliah at Mizpah) (e:Netofah khua ~’ tate) (r:24.40.8) (q:draft)
Efrat = (t:name) (c:place) (w:Ephrath) (d:older name of Bethlehem, also written Efrath) (e:amaute ~ panin a gamla sim lai) (r:1.35.16/1.35.19) (q:draft)
Ehi = (t:name) (c:male) (w:Ehi) (d:a son of Benjamin) (e:Naaman, ~, Rosh, Muppim) (r:1.46.21) (q:draft)
Eker = (t:name) (c:male) (w:Eker) (d:a son of Ram, grandson of Jerahmeel) (e:Maaz, Jamin, leh ~ ahi uh hi) (r:13.2.27) (q:draft)
El-Elohe = (t:name) (w:El Elohe Israel) (d:first part of El-Elohe-Israel, the name Jacob gave to the altar he set up) (e:~-Israel ci-in min phuak hi) (r:1.33.20) (q:draft)
Elda-ah = (t:name) (c:male) (w:Eldaah) (d:a son of Midian, descendant of Keturah) (e:Hanok, Abida, leh ~ ahi hi) (r:1.25.4/13.1.33) (q:draft)
Elead = (t:name) (c:male) (w:Elead) (d:a son of Ephraim killed by the men of Gath) (e:tuate in Ezer leh ~ ahi uh hi) (r:13.7.21) (q:draft)
Elieho-enai = (t:name) (c:male) (w:Eliehoenai) (d:name of a Levite gatekeeper and of a man who returned with Ezra) (e:Zerahiah’ tapa ~ hi a) (r:15.8.4/13.26.3) (q:draft)
Emerald = (t:n) (c:stone) (w:emerald) (d:emerald written with a capital as the name of a precious stone) (e:~ suangmanpha bangin suum pempam hi) (b:emerald) (r:66.4.3/26.28.13) (q:draft)
Enam = (t:name) (c:place) (w:Enam) (d:a town in the lowland of Judah) (e:Zanoah, Engannim, Tappuah, ~) (r:6.15.34) (q:draft)
Eshek = (t:name) (c:male) (w:Eshek) (d:a descendant of Saul, brother of Azel) (e:Azel’ sanggampa ~’ tapate in) (r:13.8.39) (q:draft)
Ethni = (t:name) (c:male) (w:Ethni) (d:a Levite, ancestor of Asaph) (e:a pa ~, a pa Zerah) (r:13.6.41) (q:draft)
