Gaddi = (t:name) (c:male) (w:Gaddi) (d:the man sent from the tribe of Manasseh to explore Canaan) (e:panin Susi’ tapa ~) (r:4.13.11) (q:draft)
Galkap = (t:n) (w:warrior/soldier) (d:galkap written with a capital in Galkap Inn, the House of the Heroes in Jerusalem) (e:~ Inn ciang dong puah hi) (b:galkap) (r:16.3.16) (q:draft)
Gamkhing = (t:n) (w:Desolate) (d:gamkhing, wasteland, written with a capital as a name given to the land) (e:na leitang pen ~, kici nawn lo ding) (b:gamkhing) (r:23.62.4) (q:draft)
