beekah = (t:adv) (w:even in/at least to) (d:beek, even, at least, with the place marker ah: khat beekah with a negative, not even in one; kiang beekah, at least to) (e:Hua vokte kiang ~ hong paisak inla) (b:beek) (r:41.5.12/42.23.14) (q:draft)
