biaibuai = (t:adv) (w:billowing/in a cloud) (d:describes smoke going up thickly; kahto biaibuai, rise in a cloud) (e:van lamah kahto ~ hi) (r:26.8.11) (q:draft, low confidence)
biakin = (t:n) (w:temple/house of worship) (d:a spelling of biakinn, from biak, worship, and inn, house) (e:~ sungah laizial sunga) (r:24.36.8/24.27.16) (q:draft)
biakkhak = (t:v) (w:worship) (d:biak, worship, with khak, happen to; biakkhak loh nading, so as not to fall into worshipping) (e:milim na ~ loh nadingun na kidawm un) (r:62.5.21/5.11.16) (q:draft)
biaknataute = (t:n) (w:altars) (e:Amah in gamdang ~ leh mual dawn-a) (b:biaknatau) (r:14.14.3/14.14.5) (q:draft)
biaksa = (t:v) (w:worshipped) (d:biak, worship, with sa, already done: that has been worshipped) (e:a na ~ pasian man lote) (b:biak) (r:30.2.4) (q:draft)
biaktheih = (t:v) (w:be able to worship/can worship) (d:biak, worship, with theih, can; biaktheih nading, so that one may worship) (e:Topa ka ~ nadingin kei hong lehzuihkik in) (b:biak) (r:9.15.25/9.15.30) (q:draft)
biangte = (t:n) (w:cheeks) (e:A ~ pen paknamtui) (b:biang) (r:22.5.13) (q:draft)
biasak = (t:v) (w:make worship/cause to worship) (d:bia, worship, with sak, cause) (e:leitung mi khempeuh a ~ hi) (b:bia) (r:66.13.12) (q:draft)
bilngongsak = (t:v) (w:make deaf) (d:bilngong, deaf, with sak, cause) (e:pau thei losak, ~, musak, mittawsak) (b:bilngong) (r:2.4.11) (q:draft)
bilun = (t:n) (w:ears/with ears) (d:bil, ear, with un, the ending in joined to the plural uh; ka bilun, with our ears) (e:Ka ~ ka zakna uh tawh kizui-in) (b:bil) (r:13.17.20/10.7.22) (q:draft)
bom = (t:n) (w:cluster/bunch) (d:a bunch of fruit; leenggah bom, a cluster of grapes) (e:leenggah ~ panin kingah a) (r:23.65.8) (q:draft)
bomah = (t:n) (w:at the crossroads/at the corner) (d:bom with the place marker ah; lamka bomah, at the place where roads meet, a crossroads or street corner) (e:Lamka ~ ding un la, khuadak un) (r:24.6.16/40.6.5) (q:draft)
bomte = (t:n) (w:clusters/bunches) (e:a ~ leenggah suakin min pah hi) (b:bom) (r:1.40.10) (q:draft)
