buaisakna = (t:n) (w:insurrection/disturbance/stirring up) (d:buaisak, trouble or stir up, with the noun suffix na; mi buaisakna, stirring up the people, an uprising) (e:Mi ~ le mi thahna hangin) (b:buaisak) (r:42.23.25/42.23.19) (q:draft)
