buknasa = (t:adj) (d:buk hide or take shelter, with na and sa already done: describes the place in which someone had been hiding) (e:amaute a ~ leihawm sungah lawnsuk uh) (b:bukna) (r:6.10.27) (q:draft)
buksimin = (t:v) (w:lying in wait/in ambush) (d:buksim lie in wait, with the linking ending in) (e:Khuaneute sungah mi a ~ tu a) (b:buksim) (r:19.10.8/19.10.9) (q:draft)
buksimna = (t:n) (w:ambush/place of ambush) (d:buksim lie in wait, with the noun suffix na: the lying in wait or the place of it) (e:na ~ panun note na kipan ding) (b:buksim) (r:6.8.7/6.8.9) (q:draft)
