dikzo = (t:adj) (w:able to be righteous/righteous) (d:dik righteous with zo be able, manage to) (e:mihing a ~ kuamah om lo hi) (b:dik) (r:19.143.2/18.25.4) (q:draft)
dimsakte = (t:n) (w:those who fill) (d:dimsak fill, make full, with the plural te: the people who fill something) (e:inn a ~ khempeuh, tua ni mahin) (b:dimsak) (r:36.1.9) (q:draft)
