ganin = (t:v) (w:weave/plait) (d:form of gan, weave, with the linking suffix in, weaving and then going on to the next action) (e:ling tawh lukhu ~ ama lu tangah) (b:gan) (r:43.19.2/7.16.13) (q:draft)
gankhawk = (t:n) (w:fold/pen/enclosure) (d:gan livestock with khawk, a marked-off section: place where a flock is gathered, named beside tuubuk sheep pen; the NIV has pasture) (e:~ sunga tuuhon kaihkhop bangin) (r:33.2.12) (q:draft, low confidence)
ganmul = (t:n) (w:wool/fleece) (d:gan livestock with mul hair; ganmul mette are the shearers) (e:~ mette na neihna ka za hi) (r:9.25.7/9.25.11) (q:draft)
ganpite = (t:n) (w:beasts/large animals) (d:gan livestock with pi, large, and plural te; named after ganhon, the herds, for the other animals a people keeps) (e:leh na ~ in a dawn dingin) (b:gan) (r:12.3.17) (q:draft, low confidence)
gapgap = (t:adv) (d:descriptive word placed after ki-en, look at each other, for people staring at one another in alarm) (e:khat leh khat a ki-en ~ uh a) (r:24.36.16) (q:draft, low confidence)
gatna = (t:n) (w:weaving) (d:gat, form of gan weave, with the noun suffix na; gatna mun is the place where weaving is done) (e:a kizang puante a ~ mun) (b:gat) (r:12.23.7) (q:draft)
gawmkik = (t:v) (w:join again/reunite) (d:gawm join with kik, again or back) (e:amaute minam khatin ka ~ ding hi) (b:gawm) (r:26.37.22) (q:draft)
gawmsa = (t:adj) (w:joined/joined together) (d:gawm join with sa, already done: what has been joined) (e:Pasian in a ~ mite) (b:gawm) (r:40.19.6/41.10.9) (q:draft)
gawngte = (t:adj) (w:lean/thin) (d:gawng lean with plural te: the lean ones, as tuu gawngte lean sheep) (e:tuu thaute leh tuu ~ kong khen ding hi) (b:gawng) (r:26.34.20) (q:draft)
gawpnate = (t:part) (d:gawpna with plural te, placed after a verb: makes a plural noun for the results of a severe action; satnim gawpnate are bruises from heavy blows) (e:satnim ~ leh meimapite) (b:gawpna) (r:23.1.6) (q:draft)
gawtbawl = (t:v) (w:mistreat/treat harshly) (d:gawt afflict with bawl do) (e:Ka ute in kei hong ~ uh a) (b:gawt) (r:22.1.6) (q:draft)
geelgeelin = (t:v) (w:ponder/meditate) (d:form of geelgeel with the linking suffix in; lung geelgeelin is turning something over in the heart) (e:lung ~ thu ka kan ciangin) (b:geelgeel) (r:19.77.6) (q:draft)
geelgeelte = (t:n) (w:plotters/those who devise) (d:geelgeel keep planning with plural te: the people who keep plotting something) (e:lumin gitlohna a ~ in gimna ngah) (b:geelgeel) (r:33.2.1) (q:draft)
geelsate = (t:n) (w:plans/purposes/things planned) (d:geelsa planned with plural te: what someone has planned or decreed) (e:a ~ amah in tungsak ding hi) (b:geelsa) (r:18.23.14) (q:draft)
geelsiam = (t:adj) (w:skilled in design) (d:geel design with siam skilled; geelsiam nasep is the work of a designer or skilled craftsman) (e:khutsiam nasep, ~ nasep) (r:2.35.35) (q:draft)
