geihualte = (t:n) (w:rims/ledges/borders) (e:a ~ na nuh ding a) (b:geihual) (r:26.43.20) (q:draft)
gelgel = (t:v) (w:plot/devise/scheme) (d:doubled form of geel, plan, in a shorter spelling: keep thinking out, in the verses always of evil) (e:a sia thei pen ~ uh hi) (r:19.41.7/23.59.7) (q:draft)
gelhsakin = (t:v) (w:have written/cause to write) (d:form of gelhsak with the linking suffix in, having something written and then going on to the next action) (e:Pilat in lai khat ~) (b:gelhsak) (r:43.19.19/41.10.4) (q:draft)
gelna = (t:n) (w:plan/plot/purpose) (d:shorter spelling of geelna, what someone has planned; paired with ngimna, aim) (e:~ leh ngimna a nei khin zo hi) (r:24.49.30/24.49.20) (q:draft)
genkhak = (t:v) (w:happen to say/say) (d:form of genkha, gen say with kha, come to do, used before loh, uh leh and the like) (e:a sia-in a ~ loh theih nadingun) (b:genkha) (r:45.14.16/24.38.25) (q:draft)
genkhiatna = (t:n) (w:proclaiming/speaking out/declaration) (d:genkhiat speak out with the noun suffix na) (e:kammal ka ~ hangin ni simin) (b:genkhiat) (r:24.20.8/24.23.30) (q:draft)
genpha = (t:v) (w:say again/repeat) (d:gen say with pha: tell something that has been told before) (e:khitui tawh ka hong ~ kikkik hi) (r:50.3.18/58.6.2) (q:draft, low confidence)
gensiatnate = (t:n) (w:slanders/evil words) (d:gensiatna with plural te: the evil things said against someone) (e:note a hong ~ uh ka thei hi) (b:gensiatna) (r:66.2.9/65.1.15) (q:draft)
gentheisak = (t:v) (w:afflict/cause distress/make suffer) (d:genthei distressed with sak, cause) (e:na pumpi uh ~ kei un) (b:genthei) (r:21.11.10) (q:draft)
genzaak = (t:v) (w:proclaim/announce) (d:gen tell with zaak, let hear: make something known aloud; written genzak in the other Bible text) (e:hotkhiatna thu a ~) (r:23.52.7) (q:draft)
genzak = (t:v) (w:proclaim/announce) (d:gen tell with zak, let hear: make something known aloud; written genzaak in the other Bible text) (e:kilemna thu a ~) (r:23.52.7) (q:draft)
genzakna = (t:n) (w:proclamation/announcement/order) (d:genzak proclaim with the noun suffix na; thu genzakna bawl is issue a proclamation) (e:thu ~ khat bawl a) (b:genzak) (r:11.15.22) (q:draft)
genzaw = (t:v) (w:speak rather/say instead) (d:gen speak with zaw, rather: speak in this way and not the other) (e:aana neite bangin thu a ~ hi) (b:gen) (r:40.7.29/41.1.22) (q:draft)
