giahphuala = (t:adv) (w:in the camp) (d:giahphual camp with the place ending a) (e:Topa in ~ om mi khempeuh) (b:giahphual) (r:7.7.22/9.14.19) (q:draft)
gialbem = (t:adj) (w:spotted) (d:gial spotted with bem round: marked with round spots; kamkei gialbem is the leopard) (e:kamkei ~ pen keelno tawh) (r:23.11.6) (q:draft)
gialheek = (t:n) (c:plant) (w:willow/poplar) (d:a tree that grows beside streams, usually with kung, tree; also written gialhek) (e:lui gei-a ~ kungte in) (r:18.40.22/23.44.4) (q:draft)
gialhekte = (t:n) (c:plant) (w:willows/poplars) (e:leh lui-a ~ na la ding uh hi) (b:gialhek) (r:3.23.40) (q:draft)
gialin = (t:adv) (w:spotted/patterned) (d:gial, spotted or patterned, with the suffix in: of animals marked with spots or streaks, and of cloth woven in a pattern) (e:dung gial, bem ~ puang uh hi) (b:gial) (r:1.31.12/2.28.39) (q:draft)
