gih = (t:adj) (w:heavy) (d:form of gik, heavy, used before ciangin: when it grew heavy) (e:a sam a ~ ciangin amah in met hi) (r:10.14.26) (q:draft)
gikzah = (t:n) (w:weight) (d:gik heavy with zah amount: how much something weighs) (e:sumngo a ~ kithei zo lo hi) (r:14.4.18/1.23.16) (q:draft)
