gokhawm = (t:v) (w:slaughter together/kill together) (d:go slaughter with khawm together: kill two animals at the same time) (e:ni khat sungin na ~ kei ding) (b:go) (r:3.22.28) (q:draft)
guahin = (t:n) (w:rain/as rain) (d:guah rain with the marker in: the rain as that which falls, with the verb zu fall) (e:leitungah ~ hong zusuk a) (b:guah) (r:21.11.3/21.1.7) (q:draft)
guahmal = (t:n) (w:raindrop/rain) (d:guah rain with mal, a single one: drops of rain) (e:~ bangin zu-in) (r:5.32.2) (q:draft)
