guakbek = (t:adj) (w:alone/lonely/by oneself) (d:guak alone with bek only: all alone) (e:Khuamial ciangin Jesuh ~ gamlakah om a) (r:40.14.23/19.25.16) (q:draft)
guakkik = (t:v) (w:return empty/come back empty) (d:guak bare or empty with kik back: come back with nothing done, said of a bow and a sword in battle) (e:namsau zong hong ~ lo hi) (b:guak) (r:10.1.22) (q:draft)
guamah = (t:n) (w:in the valley/in the valleys) (d:guam valley with the place marker ah) (e:mual leh ~ a luang luituite) (b:guam) (r:5.8.7) (q:draft)
guamteng = (t:n) (w:all the valleys/every valley) (d:guam valley with teng, all; paired with mualteng, all the hills) (e:mualteng ~ na sisan tawh kidim ding hi) (b:guam) (r:26.32.6/26.32.5) (q:draft)
