gumkhiapa = (t:n) (w:rescuer/deliverer) (d:gumkhia rescue with pa, the male one who does it; said of God) (e:Amah in ~ leh tankhiapa hi a) (b:gumkhia) (r:27.6.27/19.35.10) (q:draft)
guneite = (t:adj) (w:poisonous/venomous) (d:gunei poisonous with plural te; gul guneite are venomous snakes, vipers) (e:gul ~ kong khah ding a) (b:gunei) (r:24.8.17/18.20.16) (q:draft)
gungei = (t:n) (w:riverbank/bank of a river/riverside) (d:gun river with gei, edge or side) (e:tua ~ mahah hong paipih kik a) (r:26.47.6/24.12.5) (q:draft)
