gutapa = (t:n) (w:thief) (d:guta thief with pa, marking a man) (e:amah in ~ hi a) (b:guta) (r:43.12.6/5.24.7) (q:draft)
haamsiat = (t:v) (w:curse) (d:speak evil against someone or use a name as a curse; another spelling of hamsiat) (e:kei hong ~ teitei uh hi) (r:24.15.10/24.25.18) (q:draft)
