hahkatte = (t:n) (w:those who work hard/those who labour) (d:hahkat work hard with te, the ones who) (e:note lakah nasep a ~ leh) (b:hahkat) (r:52.5.12/54.5.17) (q:draft)
hahsawl = (t:v) (w:urge/press) (d:hah insistently with sawl, tell to do: urge someone to do something) (e:Titus a hong pai nading ka ~ a) (r:47.12.18/7.1.14) (q:draft)
