haltumsak = (t:v) (w:burn down/have burned up/destroy by fire) (d:haltum burn up with the causative sak) (e:a khua a ~ hi) (b:haltum) (r:40.22.7/38.9.4) (q:draft)
halungvei = (t:adj) (w:charging/ranging/raging) (d:said of a bear, set beside a hungry lion: on the prowl or ready to attack; the exact sense and the parts of the word are not confirmed) (e:leh vompi ~ tawh kibang hi) (r:20.28.15) (q:draft, low confidence)
hamciam = (t:v) (w:try/strive/make an effort) (d:the same meaning as hanciam, and probably another spelling of it) (e:na suahtak nadingin ~ in) (r:20.6.5/21.2.3) (q:draft)
hamsiate = (t:n) (w:curses) (e:hih ~ laibu khat sungah gelhin) (b:hamsia) (r:4.5.23) (q:draft)
