hanphual = (t:n) (w:tomb/grave/burial place) (d:han grave with phual, place or site) (e:siatna bawlte tawh ~ kibang) (r:23.53.9/42.23.55) (q:draft)
hatang = (t:n) (w:teeth/tooth) (d:ha tooth with tang, a single grain or piece: the teeth as separate pieces, the grinders of the English verse) (e:an hai nadingin na ~ tawm lua ta-in) (r:21.12.3) (q:draft)
