hatpa = (t:n) (w:strong man/strong one/mighty one) (d:hat strong with pa, a man; ka gal hatpa is my powerful enemy) (e:mi ~’ inn sungah tumin) (b:hat) (r:41.3.27/19.18.17) (q:draft)
