innlimah = (t:adv) (w:at the portico/to the portico) (d:innlim portico with the place marker ah) (e:biakinn ~ khuampite a phut hi) (b:innlim) (r:11.7.21/14.29.17) (q:draft)
itluatna = (t:n) (w:great love/deep love) (d:it love with luat very much and the noun suffix na; said of the Lord's zeal for Jerusalem, where the NIV has jealousy) (e:Jerusalem mite ka ~ hangin) (r:38.8.2) (q:draft)
