kaihkhoppih = (t:v) (w:gather with/help gather) (d:kaihkhop gather, with pih, together with: gather along with someone) (e:kei hong ~ lo peuhmah) (b:kaihkhop) (r:40.12.30/42.11.23) (q:draft)
