kaihsak = (t:v) (w:pull/seize/grab) (d:kaih pull, with sak: take hold of and pull, as a dog by its ears) (e:a bil-a ~ tawh kibang hi) (b:kaih) (r:20.26.17) (q:draft)
kaikhawmsak = (t:v) (w:gather/have gathered) (d:kaikhawm gather, with sak, cause: have people gathered together, as by sending messengers) (e:a teelsa mite a ~ ding hi) (b:kaikhawm) (r:40.24.31/41.13.27) (q:draft)
