kalkhia = (t:v) (w:reveal/uncover/bring out) (d:bring what is hidden out into the open) (e:khuamial sung panin thuthukte ~ a) (r:18.12.22) (q:draft)
kalohte = (t:n) (c:animal) (w:camels) (d:kaloh, a spelling of kalaoh camel, with plural te) (e:amah in a ~ boksak hi) (r:1.24.11/1.24.46) (q:draft)
kalsuannate = (t:n) (w:steps/footsteps) (d:kalsuanna step, with plural te) (e:Ka ~ in nangma lampi-ah kip khin a) (b:kalsuanna) (r:19.17.5/19.37.23) (q:draft)
