kamguh = (t:n) (w:bad language/unwholesome talk/rash words) (d:speech that is harmful or that should not have been said) (e:Na kiho uh ciangin ~ zang kei unla) (r:49.4.29/19.106.32) (q:draft)
kamhoih = (t:n) (w:good word/kind word/favorable answer) (d:kam word with hoih good, used with pau, speak) (e:~ pauna hangin thaman ngah a) (r:20.12.14/11.12.7) (q:draft)
