kapna = (t:n) (w:shooting) (d:kap shoot, with the noun suffix na; hong kapna thaltang is the arrows shot at us) (e:dawimangpa’ hong ~ thaltang kuangte) (b:kap) (r:49.6.16) (q:draft)
