kapsuk = (t:v) (w:beat down on/shine down on) (d:kap shoot, with suk, downward: of the sun, strike down on someone with its heat) (e:ni in zong Jonah lu zang ~ veva) (b:kap) (r:32.4.8) (q:draft)
