khekhat = (t:n) (w:one foot) (d:khe foot with khat one; found in khekhat khai bangin, as if lifting one foot, said of people who come together as one man) (e:mi khempeuh ~ khai bangin hong kikhawmtuah) (r:16.8.1/15.3.1) (q:draft, low confidence)
