khemnop = (t:adj) (w:easily deceived/gullible) (d:khem deceive with nop in the sense easy: easy to deceive; said of a silly dove) (e:a ~ kawl vakhu hai tawh kibang hi) (r:28.7.11) (q:draft, low confidence)
