khemsiamna = (t:n) (w:craftiness/cunning/deceit) (d:khem deceive with siam skilled and the noun suffix na: skill in deceiving) (e:ama nasemte, ~ tawh a bawl dingin) (r:19.105.25/19.119.118) (q:draft)
