kihaih = (t:v) (w:be sifted/be winnowed) (d:passive ki with haih sift) (e:an a ~ mah bangin keimah) (b:haih) (r:30.9.9) (q:draft)
kihangkeu = (t:v) (w:be roasted/be parched) (d:of grain, be dried by roasting over fire) (e:a ~ na pia ding hi) (r:3.2.14) (q:draft)
kihauhlawh = (t:v) (w:get rich by/be enriched) (d:hauhlawh get rich from with ki; kihauhlawh tuan lo is one is none the richer for it) (e:zong ~ tuan lo hi) (b:hauhlawh) (r:20.22.16) (q:draft)
kihawkkhia = (t:v) (w:be stripped away/be plundered/be robbed) (d:passive ki with hawkkhia strip off) (e:mi a neihsa ~ a) (b:hawkkhia) (r:19.12.5) (q:draft)
