kihaza = (t:v) (w:envy one another/be jealous of one another) (d:haza envy with ki, one another) (e:kuamah i ~ kei ding hi) (b:haza) (r:48.5.26/46.3.3) (q:draft)
kihehpih = (t:v) (w:have compassion on one another/be kind to one another) (d:hehpih pity with ki, one another) (e:Khat leh khat na ~ un) (b:hehpih) (r:49.4.32) (q:draft)
