kihilhte = (t:n) (w:teachings/instruction/things taught) (d:kihilh be taught with the plural te: the things one is taught) (e:hong ~ mang lecin) (b:kihilh) (r:20.19.20) (q:draft)
kihoin = (t:v) (w:talking with/speaking with) (d:kiho talk together with the connective in) (e:Zeisu tawh ~ Jerusalem khuapi-ah) (b:kiho) (r:42.9.31/1.43.19) (q:draft)
kihontawm = (t:v) (w:save oneself/deliver oneself) (d:hon save with ki and tawm by oneself) (e:amau leh amau ~ thei lo uh hi) (r:23.47.14) (q:draft)
kihopihin = (t:v) (w:greeting one another/talking with one another) (d:kihopih speak with each other with the connective in) (e:khat leh khat ~ i kikup khop ding) (b:kihopih) (r:64.1.14/47.13.12) (q:draft)
