kikaikhawmsa = (t:adj) (w:already gathered) (d:kikaikhawm be gathered with sa already) (e:a ~ mite banah midangte) (b:kikaikhawm) (r:23.56.8) (q:draft)
kikalhcip = (t:v) (w:be confined/be shut up/be locked up) (d:kikalh be locked with cip fast) (e:Jeremiah a ~ laitak mahin Topa) (b:kikalh) (r:24.33.1/24.32.2) (q:draft)
kikangsak = (t:v) (w:be withheld/be dried up) (d:passive ki with kangsak dry up; of rain that is kept from falling) (e:guahtui ~ a, guah nunung hong) (b:kangsak) (r:24.3.3) (q:draft)
