kikanna = (t:n) (w:search/investigation/inquiry) (d:kikan be investigated with the noun suffix na) (e:hih thu a ~ ding thu ka pia a) (b:kikan) (r:15.4.19) (q:draft)
kikanna = (t:n) (w:stretching/fastening) (d:in a kikanna khau, the cords by which a tent is stretched and held) (e:a ~ khau khempeuh kitat mangkhin hi) (b:kikan) (r:24.10.20) (q:draft, low confidence)
