kikha-in = (t:v) (w:giving in marriage) (d:found in the pair mo kipi mo kikha-in, marrying and giving in marriage; mo is a bride and in is the connective) (e:mo kipi mo ~ a om uh hi) (r:42.17.27/40.24.38) (q:draft, low confidence)
