kikhailupsak = (t:v) (w:be hanged/be hung up) (d:kikhailup be hanged with sak cause: be made to hang) (e:Makaite hong ~ a, puteekte hong) (r:25.5.12) (q:draft)
kikhaito = (t:v) (w:be lifted up/be raised) (d:passive ki with khaito hang up, raise) (e:Mihing Tapa ~ ding ci na hi) (b:khaito) (r:43.12.34/19.45.7) (q:draft)
kikhan = (t:v) (w:be extended/be enlarged) (d:khan, grow or enlarge, with the prefix ki: of a border, be made wider) (e:na gamgi uh nakpitakin ~ ding hi) (b:khan) (r:33.7.11) (q:draft)
