kikhatna = (t:n) (w:unity/oneness) (d:kikhat, be one, with the noun suffix na; lungsim kikhatna is unity of mind) (e:Pasian in lungsim ~ guan hi) (b:kikhat) (r:14.30.12) (q:draft)
