kikhawng = (t:v) (w:fetch/be sold for) (d:khawng, ask a price, with the prefix ki: of goods, bring a certain price when sold) (e:sum tampi tak ~ ding a) (b:khawng) (r:40.26.9/41.14.5) (q:draft)
kikheelsak = (t:v) (w:change/transform) (d:kheelsak, make something change, with the prefix ki; of customs changed and of the body transformed) (e:ngeina a ~ ding hi) (b:kheelsak) (r:44.6.14/50.3.21) (q:draft)
kikhek = (t:v) (w:be exchanged/change places) (d:khek, exchange, with the prefix ki: be exchanged for another thing, or of two parties, be in each other's place) (e:adang tawh zong ~ thei lo) (b:khek) (r:26.48.14/18.16.4) (q:draft)
