kikhom = (t:v) (w:last/be enough for) (d:khom, be enough to last, with the prefix ki: of fuel, last through a length of time) (e:kum sagih sung ~ ding hi) (b:khom) (r:26.39.9) (q:draft, low confidence)
kikhuatin = (t:v) (w:scrape oneself/scratch oneself) (d:khuat, scratch or scrape, with the reflexive prefix ki and the linking ending in) (e:tua tawh ~ vut lakah tu hi) (r:18.2.8) (q:draft)
kikhuituahin = (t:v) (w:be joined together/be woven together) (d:kikhuituah, be joined together, with the linking ending in; of the body being put together before birth) (e:kei hong ~ hong kibawl) (b:kikhuituah) (r:19.139.15) (q:draft)
kikhulin = (t:v) (w:be thrown into fire/be burned) (d:kikhul, be put into a fire, with the linking ending in) (e:a pumpi meikuang sungah ~) (b:kikhul) (r:27.7.11) (q:draft)
