kikhumpa = (t:n) (w:prisoner) (d:kikhum, be imprisoned, with pa marking a man: the man who is held in prison) (e:thong sungah a ~ amaute’ ngetna bangin) (b:kikhum) (r:42.23.25/44.25.27) (q:draft)
kikhungto = (t:v) (w:rise toward/go up toward) (d:kikhung, lie or run in a line toward a place, with to, up: of a hill rising in the direction of a place) (e:Seir lamah a ~ Halak Mual) (b:kikhung) (r:6.11.17/6.12.7) (q:draft)
kikhupsak = (t:v) (w:close/let close) (d:of the eyelids, let them shut in sleep) (e:ka mitkhute ka ~ kei ding hi) (r:19.132.1) (q:draft)
