muhdahhuaina = (t:n) (w:detestableness/abomination) (d:muhdahhuai detestable with the noun suffix na: the hatefulness of what was done) (e:a gamtatnasate uh a ~ phawkin) (b:muhdahhuai) (r:26.12.16) (q:draft)
