pena = (t:part) (d:pen, the marker of the superlative, most, with a: as the most; a thutang pena kineite, those counted the most upright) (e:a thutang ~ kineite) (r:33.7.4/26.40.9) (q:draft, low confidence)
pengkul = (t:n) (w:trumpet/horn) (d:another spelling of peengkul) (e:i pawi ni-in ~ tum un) (r:19.81.3/19.47.5) (q:draft)
pengthei = (t:v) (w:be able to escape/be exempt) (d:peng, be free from or escape, with thei, can) (e:nang a ~ tuam dingin kingaihsun) (b:peng) (r:24.45.5/21.8.8) (q:draft)
