petmah = (t:adv) (w:indeed/really/truly) (d:placed after a verb to stress that it has actually happened) (e:tu-in nang kong mu ~ hi) (r:20.7.15) (q:draft, low confidence)
peuhmahin = (t:adv) (d:peuhmah with the marker in; found in tu tung peuhmahin, this time, this once) (e:Tu tung ~ ka min in Topa hi) (r:24.16.21) (q:draft, low confidence)
