phasakin = (t:v) (w:multiply/make numerous) (d:phasak, make many, with the linking ending in) (e:tampi hong ~, mihing hon khatin hong bawlin) (b:phasak) (r:1.48.4/3.26.9) (q:draft)
phatkhawm = (t:v) (w:praise together) (d:phat, praise, with khawm, together) (e:nangma mite tawh kong ~ ding uh hi) (b:phat) (r:19.142.7/45.15.5) (q:draft)
