piakkholh = (t:v) (w:command beforehand/tell in advance) (d:piak give with kholh beforehand; the form of piakhol used before bangin: thu a piakkholh bangin, just as he said beforehand) (e:Thu a ~ mah bangin) (r:41.16.7/44.4.27) (q:draft)
