pialpual = (t:adv) (d:expressive word placed after satsak, make hot: heated through, inflamed; said of people heated by wine) (e:amaute a satsak ~ matengin) (r:23.5.11) (q:draft, low confidence)
pialsakin = (t:v) (w:lead astray/cause to stray) (d:pialsak cause to stray, with the linking ending in, joining it to the next verb) (e:na lampi panin kote hong ~) (b:pialsak) (r:23.63.17/48.5.7) (q:draft)
pialte = (t:n) (w:strays/those who stray) (d:pial stray with the plural te; a lam pialte, those that have left the way) (e:a lam ~ kaikhawmin) (b:pial) (r:26.34.16/26.34.4) (q:draft)
