pianngei = (t:n) (w:nature/natural state) (d:pian be born with ngei, the usual or original way: what a person or thing is by birth, by nature) (e:note’ ~ ahi lo a kiciing oliv kung) (r:45.11.24) (q:draft)
piansakte = (t:n) (w:creatures/creation/things created) (d:piansak create, cause to be, with the plural te: the things that someone has made) (e:Pasian’ ~ khempeuh a kipatna) (b:piansak) (r:66.3.14/59.1.18) (q:draft)
