siksuk = (t:v) (w:tread down on/tread upon) (d:sik, tread, with suk, downward) (e:leitung mualsang dawnte hong ~ ding hi) (b:sik) (r:33.1.3) (q:draft)
siktawn = (t:n) (w:iron rod/iron bar) (d:sik, iron, with tawn, a whole long piece; kalhna siktawn is the bar that locks a gate) (e:~ khat tawh amaute na satkham ding a) (r:19.2.9/24.49.31) (q:draft)
siktawnte = (t:n) (w:iron bars) (d:siktawn, iron bar, with plural te; the bars that lock a city gate) (e:kalhna ~ uh a kitan hi) (b:siktawn) (r:24.51.30) (q:draft)
sikzumte = (t:n) (w:lances/spears) (d:sik, iron, with zum, pointed, and plural te: pointed iron weapons) (e:namsaute leh ~ tawh) (r:11.18.28) (q:draft)
