silhsakkik = (t:v) (w:clothe again/put back on) (d:silhsak, clothe someone, with kik, again: put a person's clothes back on him) (e:ama puan mah ~ uh a) (b:silhsak) (r:40.27.31/41.15.20) (q:draft)
