siluangte = (t:n) (w:corpses/dead bodies) (d:siluang, corpse, with plural te) (e:A ~ uh van-a vasate leh) (b:siluang) (r:24.34.20/24.16.4) (q:draft)
simgawpin = (t:v) (w:attacking) (d:simgawp, attack, with the linking ending in: attack and then do something further) (e:Hih mihonte in kei hong ~) (b:simgawp) (r:18.30.12) (q:draft)
