simkhawm = (t:v) (w:attack together) (d:sim, attack, with khawm, together) (e:Filistia mite ~ ding uh a) (b:sim) (r:23.11.14) (q:draft)
simlut = (t:v) (w:steal in/slip in/enter secretly) (d:sim, secretly, with lut, enter) (e:khuapi sungah mite ~ uh hi) (r:10.19.3/10.4.6) (q:draft)
simmatin = (t:v) (w:arresting secretly/seizing by stealth) (d:sim, secretly, with mat, seize, and the linking ending in) (e:Jesuh ~ a thahtheih nading uh) (r:40.26.4/41.14.1) (q:draft)
simtatpa = (t:n) (w:hypocrite) (d:simtat, be hypocritical, with pa for a man) (e:Nang mi ~ aw) (b:simtat) (r:40.7.5/42.6.42) (q:draft)
