singkhuam = (t:n) (w:wooden post/cross/tree) (d:sing, wood, with khuam, post: the wooden post on which Jesus was put to death) (e:amah ~ tungah khai-in a that uh hi) (r:44.10.39/60.2.24) (q:draft)
