suanga = (t:v) (w:relying on/invoking) (d:suang with the linking a: taking something as one's ground or authority; min suanga, in the name of) (e:kei’ min ~ thu a gen kamsangte) (r:24.14.15/24.17.5) (q:draft, low confidence)
