sucipin = (t:v) (w:crushing/oppressing) (d:sucip crush with in, which links it to the following verb) (e:Ka mite ~ mizawngte na gawina uh) (b:sucip) (r:23.3.15/19.10.10) (q:draft)
suhgawpnate = (t:n) (w:robberies/plunder/stolen goods) (d:suh take by force with gawp violently, the noun suffix na and the plural te) (e:~ lamet-in nei kei in) (r:19.62.10) (q:draft)
suhsa = (t:v) (w:seized/taken by force) (d:suh take by force with sa, already done; placed before the thing seized) (e:nasemte in a ~ tuikhuk tawh kisai) (b:suh) (r:1.21.25) (q:draft)
