suihkhak = (t:v) (w:strike against/stumble on/dash against) (d:hit the foot against something; form of sui kha used before loh and na) (e:Na khete in suang a ~ loh nadingin) (r:19.91.12/20.4.19) (q:draft)
suite = (t:n) (w:cutters/hewers) (d:sui cut with the plural te, those who cut; sing suite are woodcutters) (e:sing ~ le tui tawite) (b:sui) (r:6.9.23/6.9.21) (q:draft)
