suksiatnate = (t:n) (w:destructions/ravages) (d:plural of suksiatna destruction) (e:~ na kihta kei ding hi) (b:suksiatna) (r:19.91.5) (q:draft)
suksiatsakin = (t:v) (w:destroying/ruining) (d:suksiatsak destroy with in, which links it to the following verb) (e:gamsate in tuate ~ gamlakpi) (b:suksiatsak) (r:28.2.12) (q:draft)
