tawnun = (t:prep) (w:throughout/all through) (d:in khan tawnun, all through life, as long as one lives; tawn along with the ending un used of several people) (e:Migilote a khan ~ khial uh hi) (b:tawn) (r:19.58.3/5.23.6) (q:draft)
tawpkhak = (t:adj) (w:last/latter/final) (d:the one at the end, set against a masa, the first) (e:a lianzaw a ~ hih dikna) (r:8.3.10) (q:draft)
