tawpta = (t:v) (w:have ceased/have stopped/be over) (d:tawp end with ta, marking a change that has now taken place) (e:a numei ngeina teng ~ hi) (b:tawp) (r:1.18.11) (q:draft)
tazo = (t:v) (w:hold/contain/have room for) (d:be large enough to take in an amount; contains zo be able) (e:khaici lawh nih a ~ dingin) (r:11.18.32/11.8.64) (q:draft)
