Nipikalte = (t:n) (w:weeks) (d:nipikal week with plural te; Nipikalte’ pawi is the Festival of Weeks) (e:~’ pawi, mangbuh a tung masa pawi) (b:nipikalte) (r:2.34.22) (q:draft)
Nipini = (t:n) (w:Sabbath day/Sabbath) (d:Nipi Sabbath with ni day) (e:~ khit ciangin, ni sagih lakah) (b:Nipi) (r:40.28.1) (q:draft)
