Onik = (t:n) (c:stone) (w:onyx) (e:Beril, leh ~, Safeiros, Karbankel) (b:onik) (r:26.28.13) (q:draft)
PA = (t:n) (w:man) (d:pa, man or male person, written in capitals in the inscription on the cross; hih pa is this man) (e:HIH ~ IN JUDAHTE’ KUMPIPA ZEISU HI) (r:40.27.37) (q:draft)
Pa-arai = (t:name) (c:male) (w:Paarai) (r:10.23.35) (q:draft)
