Pawlpi = (t:n) (w:church/congregation) (d:Pawlpi siapa is the overseer of the church) (e:~ siapa in Pasian’ neihsa kempa bangin) (b:pawlpi) (r:56.1.7) (q:draft)
Pengkulte = (t:n) (w:trumpets) (d:pengkul trumpet, also written peengkul, with plural te) (e:~ leh sa-ki aw tawh) (r:19.98.6) (q:draft)
Pere = (t:name) (c:people) (w:Perizzite) (d:Pere mite are the Perizzites) (e:Amor mite, ~ mite, Hiv mite) (r:2.3.17) (q:draft)
Perez-uzza = (t:name) (c:place) (w:Perez Uzzah) (e:tu ni dongin ~ kici hi) (r:13.13.11) (q:draft)
