Pha = (t:adj) (w:good/righteous) (d:pha good, in Mi Pha, the Righteous One, a title of Jesus) (e:Note in Mi ~ Mi Siangtho na nial) (b:pha) (r:44.3.14) (q:draft)
Phialphiah = (t:n) (c:animal) (w:swallow) (d:a small fast-flying bird) (e:a lengsuk a lengto ~ tawh kibang lel) (b:phialphiah) (r:20.26.2) (q:draft)
Phul = (t:v) (w:spring up/gush out) (d:of water, come up from a well or spring) (e:Tuikhuk aw, ~ in) (b:phul) (r:4.21.17) (q:draft)
Pia = (t:v) (w:give) (d:pia khia is give up, hand over) (e:~ khia un, leitaw lam kiangah) (b:pia) (r:23.43.6) (q:draft)
Piak = (t:v) (w:give) (d:piak, form of pia give used before a noun; Gim Piak Ni, the day suffering is given, is the day of punishment) (b:piak) (r:42.21.22) (q:draft)
Pingpeite = (t:n) (w:whirlwinds) (d:pingpei whirlwind with plural te) (e:~ leitaw lam panin hong kipat) (r:23.21.1) (q:draft)
Pokereth-hazzebaim = (t:name) (c:male) (w:Pokereth-Hazzebaim) (e:Hattil suante, ~ suante) (r:15.2.57) (q:draft)
