Siangthona = (t:n) (w:holiness) (d:Siangthona Mun, the place of holiness, is the Most Holy Place) (e:siampi ukpa in ~ Mun sungah) (b:siangthona) (r:58.9.25) (q:draft)
Siate = (t:n) (w:teachers) (d:sia teacher with plural te) (e:na ~ uh kiseel nawn lo ding) (b:siate) (r:23.30.20) (q:draft)
