Sun = (t:n) (w:day/daytime) (d:the light part of the day, opposite of zan night) (e:Pasian in khuavak pen ~ ci a) (b:sun) (r:1.1.5) (q:draft)
Sunkimlai = (t:n) (w:midday/noon) (d:sunkim noon with lai, time or middle) (e:~ hinapi ama a dingin khuamial bang) (r:24.15.9) (q:draft)
