Tawpna = (t:n) (w:end/last) (d:tawpna, end, capitalised as a title of God, the End, beside Kipatna, the Beginning) (e:a Kipatna le a ~ ka hi hi) (b:tawpna) (r:66.1.8) (q:draft)
Teci = (t:n) (w:witness) (d:teci, witness, capitalised as the name given to an altar) (e:biakna tau pen ~ phuak uh hi) (b:teci) (r:6.22.34) (q:draft)
