Theikung = (t:n) (c:plant) (w:fig tree) (d:theikung, fig tree, capitalised in the text) (e:~ nuai-ah na om lai takin) (b:theikung) (r:43.1.48) (q:draft)
Tho = (t:v) (w:rise/stand up/get up) (d:tho, rise, capitalised in the text) (e:~ in la, kong sawl khempeuh) (b:tho) (r:24.1.17) (q:draft)
