kikhoppina = (t:n) (w:great assembly/general assembly) (d:kikhop, gather, with pi, great, and the noun suffix na) (e:ta-upa pawl a ~ leh pawlpi-ah) (r:58.12.22) (q:draft)
kikhosate = (t:n) (w:those invited) (d:the people who had been invited to a feast; with sa, already done, and the plural te) (e:a ~ ahih uh leh) (r:42.14.24) (q:draft, low confidence)
kikhuma = (t:v) (w:imprisoned/in custody) (d:kikhum, be shut in, with the linking a; kikhuma om, be in custody) (e:amah tawh a ~ om) (b:kikhum) (r:1.40.7) (q:draft)
kikhumcipin = (t:v) (w:being confined/being shut up) (d:kikhumcip, be confined, with the linking suffix in) (e:Thong huang sungah ~ ka om laitakin) (b:kikhumcip) (r:24.39.15) (q:draft)
kikhumcipsak = (t:v) (w:confine/have shut up) (d:kikhumcip, be confined, with the causative sak) (e:ni sagih sung ~ in) (b:kikhumcip) (r:4.12.14) (q:draft)
kikhumte = (t:n) (w:prisoners/those imprisoned) (d:kikhum, be imprisoned, with the plural te) (e:thong sunga ~ lakah Barabbas) (b:kikhum) (r:41.15.7) (q:draft)
kikhungsuk = (t:v) (w:extend down/run down) (d:kikhung, extend, with suk, downward; of land or a border running on from a place) (e:a hong ~ gamlak a om) (b:kikhung) (r:4.21.13) (q:draft)
