kikoihkhia = (t:v) (w:be removed/be taken away) (d:kikoih, be put, with khia, out or away) (e:mualtung a biaknate ~ lo hi) (b:kikoih) (r:12.15.35) (q:draft)
kikoihkhiat = (t:v) (w:be put out/be placed outside) (d:form of kikoihkhia used before ciangin and similar words) (e:inn panin a ~ ciangin) (b:kikoihkhia) (r:44.7.21) (q:draft)
kikoihkhong = (t:v) (w:be left alone/be abandoned) (d:koihkhong, leave as is, with the passive prefix ki; in this verse the English has be disgraced) (e:maizumna kithuaksakin ~ ding hi) (b:koihkhong) (r:23.41.11) (q:draft, low confidence)
