kikoto = (t:v) (w:call out/cry out) (d:kiko, cry out, with to, upward: cry up from below) (e:taw panin ka hong ~ hi) (b:kiko) (r:25.3.55) (q:draft)
kikpa = (t:n) (d:kik, again or back, with pa, the male one who: placed after a verb, the one who does it again; a puah kikpa is the one who restores) (e:lote a puah ~ in Topa ahi) (b:kik) (r:26.36.36) (q:draft)
