kilawnkeek = (t:v) (w:be thrown down/be torn down) (d:of the stones of a building thrown down so that none is left on another; used with mang) (e:zah dongin ~ mang ding hi) (r:40.24.2) (q:draft)
kilehbulh = (t:v) (w:be contrary/contradict/be opposite) (d:be the opposite of something, used with tawh; here of deeds that go against what is claimed) (e:a gamtatnate uh tawh ~ hi) (r:56.1.16) (q:draft)
kilehbulhin = (t:adv) (w:contrary to/in opposition to) (d:kilehbulh, be contrary, with in; used with tawh) (e:thuman tawh a ~ a gamta mite) (b:kilehbulh) (r:54.1.10) (q:draft)
