kilemsakna = (t:n) (w:reconciliation) (d:kilemsak, reconcile, with the noun suffix na) (e:tua ~ thu kote hong pia hi) (b:kilemsak) (r:47.5.19) (q:draft)
kilen = (t:v) (w:hold one another/embrace) (d:len, hold, with the reciprocal prefix ki) (e:khatlekhat ~ kikawi-in a kap uh hi) (b:len) (r:44.20.37) (q:draft)
kilenin = (t:v) (w:holding/being held) (d:kilen with the linking suffix in; a khut kilenin is holding him by the hand) (e:a khut ~ a paipih dingin) (b:kilen) (r:44.13.11) (q:draft)
kilenkhiatsak = (t:v) (w:be blown away/be driven away) (d:of smoke made to fly off) (e:Meikhu a ~ bangin amaute hawlkhia ding) (r:19.68.2) (q:draft)
kiletna = (t:n) (w:handshake/clasping of hands) (d:found in khut kiletna, the giving of the hand to one another as a sign of fellowship) (e:Barnabas tawh khut ~ hong bawl uh) (r:48.2.9) (q:draft, low confidence)
kilhcipin = (t:v) (w:nailing/nailing fast) (d:kilhcip, nail fast, with the linking suffix in) (e:singlamteh tungah ~ a beisak ta hi) (b:kilhcip) (r:51.2.14) (q:draft)
kiliahin = (t:v) (w:being hidden/being covered) (d:kiliah, be hidden, with the linking suffix in; of the light of understanding, where the English has darkened) (e:pilna khuavak ~ Pasian’ nuntakna tawh) (b:kiliah) (r:49.4.18) (q:draft)
kiliin = (t:v) (w:sway/shake/tremble) (d:liin, tremble, with the prefix ki; of a reed moving in the water) (b:liin) (r:11.14.15) (q:draft)
