kipattung = (t:n) (w:beginning/very start) (d:kipat begin with tung at first; a kipattung lamin, at the beginning) (e:manin a ~ lamin hih thute) (r:43.16.4) (q:draft)
kipatun = (t:n) (w:beginning/start) (d:the start of something, here of speaking; probably the same as kipattung) (e:Thugen a ~ bang tum lo) (r:21.10.13) (q:draft, low confidence)
kipawlbawl = (t:v) (w:become friends/make friends with each other) (d:kipawl associate, with bawl make) (e:tegel kilem kikin ~ uh hi) (b:kipawl) (r:42.23.12) (q:draft)
kipawlkha = (t:v) (w:join with/associate with) (d:kipawl associate, with kha happen to; with kei, do not get involved with) (e:amau a langpangte tawh ~ kei in) (r:20.24.21) (q:draft)
kipawlkhawm = (t:v) (w:become allies/form an alliance) (d:kipawl associate, with khawm together) (e:kumpipa in a ~ theih nadingin) (b:kipawl) (r:27.11.6) (q:draft)
