kiphelphel = (t:v) (w:keep defending oneself/defend oneself) (d:kiphel, defend oneself, doubled for a repeated action; used with mawhna) (e:ka mawhna uh a ~ bang khatin) (r:47.12.19) (q:draft)
kiphelsa = (t:adj) (w:open/opened) (d:kiphel, be untied or loosed, with the completive suffix sa; said of a scroll that lies open) (e:a om laizial ~ pen va la in) (b:kiphel) (r:66.10.8) (q:draft)
