kiphenin = (t:v) (w:be open/lie open) (d:kiphen, be opened, with the linking ending in; said of a book or scroll) (e:khut sungah ~ a om laibu) (b:kiphen) (r:66.10.8) (q:draft)
kiphin = (t:v) (w:provoke each other) (d:ki, each other, with phin, provoke) (e:Kuamah kiphasak loin, khatlekhat ~ loin) (b:phin) (r:48.5.26) (q:draft)
kiphokhia = (t:v) (w:be exposed/be spread out) (d:kipho, be spread out, with khia, out: be laid out in the open) (e:khempeuh mai-ah a ~ ding hi) (b:kipho) (r:24.8.2) (q:draft)
