kipulakin = (t:v) (w:confess to each other) (d:ki, each other, with pulak, confess, and the linking ending in) (e:khatlekhat tungah na mawhna uh ~ thu) (b:kipulak) (r:59.5.16) (q:draft)
kipum = (t:v) (w:be united/be one whole) (d:in kipum khat, being as one, in unity) (e:Tapa theihna ah ahi zongin, ~ khatin) (r:49.4.13) (q:draft, low confidence)
kipumpiak = (t:v) (w:give oneself/give oneself wholly) (d:give one's whole self for others) (e:Jesuh amahmah hong ~ a) (r:56.2.14) (q:draft)
kipusuahpih = (t:v) (w:be taken outside/be put out) (d:passive of pusuahpih, bring out) (e:sawltakte a ~ nadingin thu pia a) (b:pusuahpih) (r:44.5.34) (q:draft)
kipusuak = (t:v) (w:come out/come forth) (d:pusuak, come out, with the prefix ki; followed by sak, cause to come forth, rouse) (e:misi uliante ~ sak hi) (b:pusuak) (r:23.14.9) (q:draft, low confidence)
kipusuaksak = (t:v) (w:be brought out/be roused) (d:kipusuak, come forth, with the causative sak: be made to come forth; said of the dead being roused) (e:misi uliante ~ hi) (b:kipusuak) (r:23.14.9) (q:draft, low confidence)
