kizoma = (t:v) (w:connected/in succession) (d:kizom be joined, with the linking ending a; in the verse of descent from the fathers) (e:a pate tawh ~ piang mi) (b:kizom) (r:45.9.5) (q:draft)
kizomsuak = (t:v) (w:continue/endure) (d:go on without a break, said of a reign) (e:tu-in na ukna ~ lo ding a) (b:zomsuak) (r:9.13.14) (q:draft)
kizomto = (t:v) (w:continue upward) (d:kizom be joined or continue, with to upward) (e:a tungnung dongin ~ hi) (b:kizom) (r:26.41.7) (q:draft)
kizomzomin = (t:adv) (w:in order/consecutively) (d:one thing following another) (e:a thu a ~ nang a dingin) (r:42.1.3) (q:draft)
kizopkhak = (t:v) (w:have contact with/be involved with) (e:a sia peuhmah tawh na ~ hetloh) (r:45.16.19) (q:draft)
kizuaksak = (t:v) (w:cause to be sold/sell) (d:kizuak be sold, with the causative sak) (e:Judah mite tungah ka ~ ding a) (b:kizuak) (r:29.3.8) (q:draft)
